GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FISH_MED_COOKED = "The grilling makes it easily digestible."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FISH_RAW = "My experiments eating raw seafood always end in disaster."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FISH_RAW_SMALL = "Even miniscule amounts of raw fish will cause my intestines harm."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FISH_RAW_SMALL_COOKED = "Ah. It should be okay for me to consume it now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLAMEGEYSER = "A chance peak into the planet's core!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLINT = "Its sharpness can be exploited to build many rudimentary tools."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLOTSAM = "Debris from a shipwreck. But whose ship?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLOWER = "I feel oddly comforted by picking these. How compelling..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT = "It counteracts the effects of psychic attack! Fascinating!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD = "Edible flowers! I shall consume them with gusto!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE = "Is it radioactive? I hope so."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_DOUBLE = "Have they an attraction to one another?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_TRIPLE = "A cluster of chemiluminescent blossoms."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL = "Theoretically it has been in contact with some of that dark fuel."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_RAINFOREST = "Curious. Picking these has a positive effect on my psyche."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FLUP = "An incredible amphibious fish! Let me take a look at you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE = "I predict stomach upset resulting from it consumption."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT = "Has oddly large protective qualities given its considerable softness."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES = "Buttery bounty of a berry blintz!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROG_DEAD = "Fantastic! It's ready for dissection."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROG_GENERIC = "A impressive criminal of the animal kingdom!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROG_SLEEPING = "I can examine it more closely in its somnolent state."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH = "Ah. Some sustenance I can digest."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS = "I predict my stomach will reject this foodstuff."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED = "Oh! A rare delicacy I can enjoy!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON = "Observations lead me to conclude this will cause me harm."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON_COOKED = "Relatively less detrimental than before."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON_DEAD = "Based on observations, I can reasonably deduce it is dead."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON_GENERIC = "It's reasonable to conclude that this amphibian means me harm."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON_SLEEPING = "A dozing dendrobatidae."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY = "A lovely concoction of consumables."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT = "There's an altogether musty smell to it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GASCLOUD = "A cloud of toxic chemicals. Intriguing!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GASHAT = "Amazing! It functions without requiring a sealed cover over the mouth!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GASMASKHAT = "It appears that those ocular plumes are great at air filtration."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GEARS = "Remarkably versatile cogs! They could fit some of my creations."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET_GEMS = "Requires stones of an amaranth color."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET_VALID = "Contains a precisely placed gem of a particular pigment."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GHOST = "A poltergeist not affected by the dark fuel."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GHOST_SAILOR = "Amazing! It's sporting spectral headwear and facial hair!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GIANTGRUB = "It appears to have a contentious relationship with the humanoid hexapod invertebrates."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER = "Such a complex arrangement of oculus!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER_DEAD = "Evidentaly, its attractive properties cease at death."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER_GENERIC = "Its smell appears to be attracting that flying creature."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL = "An entirely innovative source of energy!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS = "How did these wings support such a bulky creature?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_DEAD = "Cadaverous."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_GENERIC = "The luminous oculus on this pterygota is inspiring!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_SLEEPING = "Evidently, its bioluminescence is dormant too."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_COCOON = "It appears to be undergoing some kind of transubstantiation. "
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GNAT = "Their capacity for aggravating behavior is truly astounding!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GNATMOUND = "The nest of those exceptionally annoying bugs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK = "Smells curiously of ozone and lactate."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESARMORHAT = "I designed it so I can study sound reverberations while I'm engaged in combat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHEATHAT = "I do hope to catch a glimpse of the night creature with these."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESNORMALHAT = "Refracted lenses polished to a specific curvature so I can see better."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESSHOOTHAT = "Tiny spheres of static energy make a marvelous flaming projectile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE = "Fascinating! Gold has much more durable properties here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE = "Gold is so plentiful here I can use it in household tools."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE = "Strange, the gold makes it more durable, not less."
