GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL = "Strangely more durable than its stone counterpart."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET = "Oddly more common here than lead or copper."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOLDPAN = "I do hope the holes were meant to be there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST = "Evidently, it's the preferred sustenance of those long nosed quadrupeds."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER = "Holds a strange connection to the elements."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GRABBING_VINE = "Kleptomaniac vegetation. How wonderful!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GRASS_BARREN = "I deduce it requires fertilization."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GRASS_BURNING = "An alluring example of thermodynamics."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GRASS_GENERIC = "Has an unusually strong tensile strength."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GRASS_PICKED = "Luckily the growth rate here is extraordinarily rapid."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GRASS_WITHERED = "Presumably it's the heat that is causing it to wither."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL_BURNING = "Evidently, grass here has the same flammability qualities as at home."
