GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF = "The stone must act as a conduit for the dark energy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP = "Raw fungus is not something my stomach can process."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED = "I deduce the cooking has made it more digestible."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM_GENERIC = "I will have to cook it to take advantage of its medicinal properties."
