GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT = "Remarkably destructive yet still susceptible to food spoilage."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.HAMMER = "For use on inanimate objects. Akin to a dissection scalpel."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.HANGING_VINE = "Kleptomaniac vegetation. How wonderful!"
