GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER_GENERIC = "That remarkable beak would be excellent for crushing seeds."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER_SLEEPING = "The bird appears to be in some kind of sonamolant state."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT = "A triumphant piece of combat ready cogwork."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KNIGHTBOAT = "Amazing! I ran into many difficulties waterproofing my automaton."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE = "I would very much like to see its insides."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER = "Ah ha! I have discovered the maker of all those tracks."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER = "Its coat color appears to be dependent on the season."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN = "What an awe-inspiring vitriolic creature! I need a closer look!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KRAKENCHEST = "The spoils of my skirmish with that sizable sea creature."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN_TENTACLE = "The destructive limbs on this creature are quite fascinating!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS = "He appears to be drawn to my moral ambiguity."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK = "Holds more supplies but weighs less than a backpack. It defies all known laws of physics!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LANTERN = "A portable source of illumination that will no doubt come in handy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVAE = "How adorably annihilative!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_GENERIC = "It's emitting an enormous amount of thermal energy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED_COLD = "Requires thermal energy for incubation."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY = "The ambient temperature is ideal for incubation."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET_CONTENT = "Content with combustible comestibles."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET_GENERIC = "Its thermal energy emissions are quite calming."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET_HUNGRY = "In search of scorched sustenance."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET_STARVING = "I must find a source of burnt carbon immediately!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH = "Has a strange hold over those febrile juveniles."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL = "Appears to have erupted from a creature, not the earth's core."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT_COOL = "Spectacular smouldering spittle."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT_HOT = "A mass of magmatic mucus!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND = "The nest of that flying reptile. Fascinating!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK = "Theoretically, it's a rock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK2 = "Theoretically, it's a rock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK3 = "Theoretically, it's a rock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK4 = "Theoretically, it's a rock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK5 = "Theoretically, it's a rock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK6 = "Theoretically, it's a rock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK7 = "Theoretically, it's a rock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT_BURNING = "A delightful demonstration of combustion!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT_BURNT = "Presumably it was once not burnt."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT_GENERIC = "Urban ornamentation. Theoretically, it increases mental wellness."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LEATHER = "Animal dermis makes for a substantially resilient material."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LEIF = "A possessed tree! What a revelation!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE = "Its agitation increases the more trees I cleave. Fascinating!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LICHEN = "It's truly amazing that something could grow in this environment."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIF_PLANT = "Insurance in case a dangerous experiment goes awry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB = "Chemiluminescence at work."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER = "An odd artifact. Who could have dropped it?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT_CHARGED = "Fascinating... The electrostatic discharge has infused it with rage."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT_GENERIC = "Those horns look like insulated wire. Curious..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN = "No wire within. How does it hold a charge?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD_CHARGED = "Curious, it gives off light energy but no thermal energy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD_GENERIC = "Attracts the electrostatic discharge of a lightning strike."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LILYPAD = "Fascinating! It contains a small ecosystem of animals."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONE = "Sedimentary rock composed of coral."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIMPETROCK_GENERIC = "Appears to have attracted sea creatures to its surface."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIMPETROCK_PICKED = "I can reasonably assume it will attract more sea creatures."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS = "I will refrain from eating this in its raw form."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED = "Theoretically it will cause me less stomach upset in this form."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS = "Did he weave that wonderful piece of tartan?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIVINGJUNGLETREE = "Glorious! A possessed tree! I need a closer look."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG = "I do wish logs at home were similarly afflicted."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE = "I've never seen such vitality in a tree!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LIVING_ARTIFACT = "An ancient war machine! I must appraise its funtionality!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER = "What a complex cephalothorax! I'm going to eat it for dinner!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE = "Its exoskeleton is still a marvelous shade of blue."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER = "I do like watching its exoskeleton turn red."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERHOLE = "An unusual home for a crustacean."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD = "I do not want to experiment with eating raw seafood."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD_COOKED = "Its muscular cephalothorax makes for some good eatin'."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOCKEDWES = "A performance artist! Who could have imprisoned him like this?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOG_BURNING = "Combusting beautifully."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOG_GENERIC = "Cross-section of a tree. For fuel and construction purposes."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOGRAFT = "The dispersal of weight should keep me briefly afloat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOTUS = "Ah. A water based plant with attractive flowers. I should pick it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER = "Theoretically, it's edible. Though I should cook it to avoid stomach problems."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER_COOKED = "A salubrious plant capable of boosting mental wellness."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LUCY = "Strange waves of energy are emanating from it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST = "Whose luggage is that? And where are they now?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LUR_PLANT = "Much like the anglerfish, its lure is very tempting."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB = "What an amazing amalgam of flower and flesh."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MACHETE = "A pragmatic tool for slashing objects."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAGIC_SEAL = "Wonderful. It's a conduit for that dark fuel."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK = "A collection of igneous rocks. Theoretically from a volcano."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_FULL = "A collection of igneous rock. Theoretically from a volcano."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD = "An igneous rock formation fortuitously flecked with gold."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD_FULL = "An igneous rock formation fortuitously flecked with gold."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS = "Excellent! A burning glass!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET = "I do so wish I could supplant him."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_DEAD = "It appears to be adverse to light rays."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_GENERIC = "The appearance of that root raises my curiosity."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PICKED = "Its screech is of a remarkably annoying register. "
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEHOUSE = "Evidence would suggest it belongs to some sort of vegetation based humanoid."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEMAN = "He appears to be influenced by this world's satellite. Intriguing!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP = "Death has not prevented that vegetable from enjoying a bath."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED = "It smells faintly of thebaine. Interesting..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE = "An impressive root system. In theory it would help avoid water saturation."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE_BURNT = "Its proximity to water was not enough to impede combustion."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL = "A 10 on the \"Fluffiness Index\"."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARBLE = "The mineral used by the architect of those mysterious statues."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR = "I would very much like to talk to the architect of that structure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE = "A deposit of metamorphic rock in the form of a tree."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH_BURNING = "Wood is combustible. Even in this damp environment."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH_GENERIC = "An abundant source of twigs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH_PICKED = "Given the rapid growth rate here, it should grow back soon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT = "A decorative plant of no practical use."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT_TROPICAL = "I can reasonably deduce this is a plant of some kind."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE_BURNING = "Scientific proof that this tree is combustible."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE_BURNT = "Evidence that a fire has occurred here recently."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE_CHOPPED = "Cleaving it has cut short its ability to survive."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE_GENERIC = "It abounds with twigs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL = "Looks like a man who could answer some of my quandaries."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD = "A beheaded behemoth or an optical illusion?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT = "A light source that sensitive to motion! Revolutionary!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK = "Interesting. Previous ones weren't so inundated with darkness."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH = "Ah, the Gramophone ML-77. I know it well."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE = "I've found it! The portal that can link worlds! The throne of ultimate power!!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP_DEAD = "Lifeless."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP_GENERIC = "Evidently, it's a juvenile. And particularly attracted to meat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP_SLEEPING = "Does it dream of consuming life forms?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MEAT = "It needs cooking before I can consume it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS = "These round spheres of meat should be digestible."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_BURNT = "Perhaps it was a little too dry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_DONE = "Food dries so rapidly here!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_DRYING = "Still undergoing the evaporation process."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_DRYINGINRAIN = "The moist atmosphere is not helping the drying process."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_GENERIC = "Not the most sophisticated tool but it will do."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED = "Theoretically, it's less susceptible to spoilage now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MERM = "A marvelous humanoid. Perhaps it has evolved from the marshy depths."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MERMFISHER = "Curious. These creatures appear to enjoy engaging in hobby fishing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD_BURNT = "Perhaps it is the result of a sacrifice?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD_GENERIC = "Strangely supple dermis for something that's deceased."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_BURNT = "The burnt husk of a building."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_GENERIC = "What are they getting up to in there?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_FISHER = "The domicile of a marshy humanoid obsessed with fishing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE = "An enthralling missive from a mysterious being."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY = "A shame. I was looking forward to a communication."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.METALPLATEHAT = "Incredibly durable. Though incredibly dense as well."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT = "The lens must focus the bioluminescence."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_GENERIC = "A wonderfully effective way to categorize my things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_UNDRAWN = "It will be of better use if it's drawn upon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM = "Its function is better realized when it is stuck in the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR = "Astonishingly similar to its clockwork counterpart."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST = "I suspect a trap, but the lure of curiosity is strong."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN = "It's emitting strange wavelengths of energy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOLE_ABOVEGROUND = "An entirely unusual creature formed from entirely usual ones."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOLE_HELD = "I suspect it has a very complex sense of smell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOLE_UNDERGROUND = "A burrower and a borrower."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT = "Converts scents to visual light waves."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL = "The home of a subterranean creature."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MONKEY = "Akin to its earthly kin."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBALL = "He he. I can see what those simians see in this amusing sphere."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL = "Holds a concentrated compound of fun."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA = "A pungent pasta that will no doubt do me harm."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT = "Interesting, it is neither a red meat nor a white meat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED = "Edible, but not enticing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE = "I suppose a culinary experiment is in order."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET = "Fascinating! These are nothing like the meteorites I've seen."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOOSE = "There are a fascinating number of chimeras in this world."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG = "Giving off a fair amount of heat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND = "Mammal bird hybrid young are incubating."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_GENERIC = "Fascinating. Do they carry diseases like the ones I know?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_HELD = "Its plasma sacks are quite valuable for medicinal purposes."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK = "Quite convenient should I need to perform a plasma infusion on myself."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK_YELLOW = "Theoretically, it could be used as an antivenom."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_POISON = "I presume they carry diseases here too."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING = "An animal capable of wind manipulation! Extraordinary!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOUND_DUG = "Defiled for the sake of knowledge."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MOUND_GENERIC = "Could potentially yield secret property. And a poltergeist."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE = "A revelation! Two tools have been merged into one!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM = "Fungal parasites are taking over."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL = "Fascinating! Fungus camouflaged as a tree!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL = "I believe that fungus is assaulting that tree."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED = "A web entrapped parasite. Truly a predatory ecosystem."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL = "Consuming raw seafood never produces favorable results for me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MUSSELBOUILLABAISE = "A hearty broth of molluscs is good for the digestion."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_BED = "Theoretically, I can farm my own bivalve molluscs here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_COOKED = "Significantly more pleasurable when consumed cooked."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM_GENERIC = "What fantastic creatures lurk in its depths?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM_STICKPLANTED = "Theoretically, bivalve molluscs will be attracted to it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_STICK = "An ingenious invention fabricated from readily available materials."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MYSTERYMEAT = "I can reasonably deduce this will end in gastrointestinal distress."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NECTAR_POD = "Requires an enzymatic processor to convert it to honey."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NEEDLESPEAR = "The destructive projectile of a cactus. I can hit things with it!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_DEFAULT = "I detect a faint scent of eucalyptus. Interesting..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_EMPTY = "It will grow back in time."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_MOIST = "Ah, it is cultivating quite nicely."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_WITHERED = "Evidently its current conditions are not ideal for it to grow."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NETTLELOSANGE = "The coiled fronds of a nettle plant which serve as allergy medication."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT = "Amazing. It emits a psychic attack along with light energy!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL = "I must find a way to return with this. It will revolutionize the world!!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT = "Yet another ingenious use of that fascinating dark fuel."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_CALM = "It's attuned to areas of psychic attack."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_DAWN = "The psychic attacks are over. What a shame!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_NOMAGIC = "I'll need to find a place where this works."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_STEADY = "Hohoo! I'm being hit with fluctuating psychic attacks!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_WANING = "The pulses are coming less frequently now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_WARN = "It's picking up fluctuations."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_WAXING = "It's releasing a pulse. Almost as if it were alive!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK = "Curious. It smells faintly of ozone."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD = "Dark fuel forged into a fascinating weapon! Its military applications are endless!"
