GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR = "Requires a small sacrifice of rabbits for the sake of a war machine."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SAIL = "Passable material for capturing wind currents."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SAIL_STICK = "A superlative utilization of dark fuel. The world will be better for its introduction!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK = "A cube of sodium to placate my domesticated bovine."
