GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SANDBAG_ITEM = "Presumably, it will hold back the encroaching tide."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SANDHILL = "An accumulation of granular materials."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SAND_CASTLE_GENERIC = "Fascinating, it seems to add protection against psychic attack."
