GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK_ACTIVE = "Ingenious! It must be tuning in to my beta waves! "
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK_INACTIVE = "I would very much like to talk with its engineer!"
