GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SAPLING_GENERIC = "I predict it will be a tree soon enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SAPLING_PICKED = "Experience dictates it will grow back."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SAPLING_WITHERED = "The weather has withered it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON = "A lesson in the effects of combustion on human anatomy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SCORPION_DEAD = "Cold and lifeless."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SCORPION_GENERIC = "A wonderful example of a predatory arachnid! And poisonous to boot!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SCORPION_SLEEPING = "My first inclination is to poke it with a stick."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO = "Still contains the skeletal remains of a fish."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL = "I find it disheartening to know there are seagulls here too."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL_WATER = "A little more hostile than the ones I'm used to."
