GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SMELTER = "Magnificent! Perhaps I can build a factory here as well."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKE = "A fantastically vile reptile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKEBONESOUP = "The skeletal remains should add some calcium to my diet."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN_BURNT = "Evidence of an exothermic reaction."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN_CHOPPED = "Based on past evidence, I can theorize this will grow back."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN_GENERIC = "Ah! Those gnarled branches look very useful."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL = "Ah, I made a fortune selling such concoctions in my youth."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN = "The repellant properties of this skin are inspiring!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT = "Smells not unlike wet snake."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINSAIL = "Theoretically, it's reliable despite its patchy appearance."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_AMPHIBIOUS = "What a wonderfully vicious reptile! I would like its skin."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_BONE = "The skeletal remains of a carnivorous reptile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_FIRE = "A fantastically carnivorous reptile emitting a plethora of exothermic energy!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_POISON = "I highly suspect that it is poisonous."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_DEAD = "Rigor mortis has yet to set in."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_GENERIC = "Such a wonderfully homicidal plant! I should get closer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_SLEEPING = "I'm tempted to poke it with a stick."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE = "A copious amount of creatures in this environment have a diet of minerals."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH = "Curious, do its ears act as fins?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPAT = "A harsh and phlegmatic creature."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPEAR = "Not incredibly effective weapon, but it has other uses."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPEARGUN = "A tool to propel homicidal weapons at an enemy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPEARGUN_POISON = "A pernicious propellant."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LAUNCHER = "A fine example of applied elasticity."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_OBSIDIAN = "Initial observations suggest the obsidian gets really hot."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_POISON = "Luckily the venom gland doesn't weigh down the tip of the spear."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR = "Ornate, but I suspect it's not a real artifact."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPICYVEGSTINGER = "Ah. A daily dose of vegetables restores the mental faculties."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DEAD = "I would like to dissect that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_GENERIC = "I've never heard such a vocal arachnid!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SLEEPING = "Incredible! It appears to be snoring!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN = "It appears to be growing. Almost as if it were alive."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK = "A spider den in its juvenile form."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND = "Properly processed, this could have medicinal properties."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT = "A brain wave converter! Incredible!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE = "I am very curious about its arachnid generating properties."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN = "Did she evolve from the spider den?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER = "Fascinating. They make gravity work for them."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER = "Does its eye allow it to see in the infrared? I wonder..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_DEAD = "Fairly recently deceased."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_GENERIC = "Presumably, the terrifying arachnid arms are just vestigial."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_SLEEPING = "I wonder if he is dreaming of decimating something."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_NEST = "Curious. How does the big behemoth get up the tree?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_TREE = "A tree asphyxiated by webbing. Truly amazing!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER = "It appears arachnids here don't spin webs from their posterior."
