GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR_GENERIC = "The green appears to indicate an aggressive type."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR_SLEEPING = "I can examine it more closely this way."
