GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD = "No longer ideal for consuming."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM = "A parasitic aerial assault. Absolutely fascinating."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM_INV = "There's a soft glow radiating from it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL = "Ah, the riveting dance of airborne blight."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL_INV = "Radiating light in the 600 THz range."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL = "Airborne microbes."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL_INV = "Their chemiluminescence could be put to good use."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SPRINKLER = "A dynamic mechanical atomizer of H2O!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT = "It's particularly good at focusing light."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO = "Where does the air current originate?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE = "Presumably it's formed from ceiling drippings."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_FULL = "There are resources within. I'm certain of it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_LOW = "It may still have traces of resources."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_MED = "A chance it still holds resources."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL = "Quite an interesting geometric shape."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL_FULL = "There's a non-zero probability it contains gold."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL_LOW = "I do wonder what's in it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL_MED = "Still worth mining."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER_EMPTY = "How strange! It's composed of just regular marble."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER_GENERIC = "Something in the stone must cultivate the flower."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP = "Who could this be modeled after? And where is his head?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL = "I would very much like to talk to him."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH = "Delightfully devilish."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL = "Compositionally unique from wool I'm used to."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STINGER = "Its small size and sharp point will come in handy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STONE_DOOR = "The doorway to expanding my horizons."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT = "Required a large amount of grass to construct. But fairly worth the effort."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEG_PLANT = "Erupting with nourishment."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.STUNGRAY = "An absolutely amazing animal with fatal fumes."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKBOAT = "I wonder who owns that?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_ABANDONED = "Evidentaly, there were a number of sailors here before me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_GENERIC = "What a curious parrot! I wonder if he'll speak with me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_BURNT = "Theoretically, it was fuel for a fire."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_1 = "Ah! A reflecting navigation instrument!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2 = "Appears to be seaworthy, but much too diminutive to be useful."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_3 = "Was this candle burnt here, or somewhere else?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_4 = "Amazing! It appears to work similar to my radio."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_5 = "I'm afraid it is not my size."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_RELIC = "Based on observations and angles of refraction, there appears to be something down there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SUPERTELESCOPE = "The refraction properties of that lens is astonishing!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF = "There is a lot of meat based protein in this concoction."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST = "The hound's tooth has proven quite comfortable. Interesting..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATOSOUFFLE = "A hearty vegetable meal. Good for the constitution."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO = "Consuming raw potatoes is never a good idea. Even sweet ones."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_COOKED = "Quite a delicious snack."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_PLANTED = "Cultivating quite nicely."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_SEEDS = "Evidently, it will grow sweet potatoes."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWIMMINGHORROR = "A creature made of the dark fuel! I must get closer!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT1 = "Auroral."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_BULB = "Revolutionary!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_BASIC_METAL = "Riveting."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_CHANDALIER_CANDLES = "Incendiary."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_DERBY = "Attractive."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BLOOMER = "Enticing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_BULB = "Glamorous."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_FLORAL_SCALLOP = "Delectable."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_PENDANT_CHERRIES = "Ravishing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_1 = "Inspired!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_ROPE_2 = "Entwined."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWINGING_LIGHT_TOPHAT = "Charming."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH = "What a magnificently cuspidated creature!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TAFFY = "Comprised mostly of honey. But I am not complaining."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD = "That eye! How penetrating!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG = "I would very much like to incubate this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED = "Strange. It appears to be unfertilized."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED_COLD = "In need of thermal energy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED_GENERIC = "Has a rather short incubation time."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED_HOT = "It is soaking up the thermal waves!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED_LONG = "It is soaking up the thermal waves."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED_SHORT = "Its hatching is imminent!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST_GENERIC = "Oh wonderful! It contains an egg!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST_PICKED = "Not currently occupied with an ovum."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TAR = "An excellent source of combustible material. But it sure does stink."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TARLAMP = "A simple yet effective design. Still smells though."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TARSUIT = "An entirely effective rain suit! Could be a bit more durable."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR_LOWFUEL = "Evidence suggests it needs more tar."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR_OFF = "It requires the turning of a switch to function."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR_ON = "Splendid. We very much need something like this at home."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TAR_POOL = "A highly combustible source of fuel lays just beneath the waves."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TAR_TRAP = "Outstanding! An enormously efficient way to defeat enemies."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TEA = "A rodent based broth that tastes remarkably like tea!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TEATREE = "Theoretically, its smell attracts those small rodents. Intriguing..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT = "My stomach condition prevents me from partaking in its health benefits."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_COOKED = "Of a chewy consistency. Evidently, it's good for you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_SAPLING = "Displays the same rapid growth rate of the other trees here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD_GENERIC = "Its legs underwent an incredible growth spurt!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD_HUNGRY = "Requires sustenance to continue."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD_STARVING = "In dire need of food!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE_GEMS = "Requires stones of an amaranthine color."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE_VALID = "A focus for spacetime manipulation."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEBRELLA = "A short range, aerial teleportation antenna in convenient-to-carry umbrella form."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_ACTIVE = "An inspired design! I must remember it for building future portals!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_GENERIC = "My design is quite similar to this. Though, without those runes..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_LOCKED = "Requires a PR-76 tuned to the right frequency."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_PARTIAL = "Evidently, it requires a few more items."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX = "Ah yes! This is exactly what I need."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK = "A crank! And it's a perfect fit!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_BASE = "Ingenious! Just the size and shape I need."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_BOX = "The perfect height and width for experimental physics."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_CRANK = "Ah yes, this will combine the different dimensional fabrics quite nicely."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_POTATO = "Fascinating! Its contents exist in more than three dimensions!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_RING = "Theoretically, it guards against fluctuating quantum fields."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO = "An imperfectly constructed head of an automaton. I will put it to good use."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING = "Perfect! Its circumference is exactly to specifications."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BASE = "Not exactly refined, but theoretically it will still work."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BOX = "It looks cobbled together. The science is sound though."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_CRANK = "I do believe this is a crank! Made of grass?!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_POTATO = "A wooden automaton head?! Extraordinary!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_RING = "It's inelegant, but it will still work."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELESCOPE = "The glass bottle makes an uncommonly good looking glass."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF = "So it is possible to bend three dimensional space. I knew it!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TELIPAD = "The receiver pad for my short range teleportation device."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TENT_BURNT = "It's fortuitous I was not in it at the time."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TENT_GENERIC = "Its restorative properties are quite intriguing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE = "Arms from the depths! But where is the rest of the body?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE = "A ruthless weapon I should put to frequent use."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS = "A stretchy consistency. Not unlike rubber."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN = "The life cycle of these creatures is truly amazing!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR = "The temptation to wake it up is almost unbearable."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM = "Glorious! A grasping gargantuan appendage!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE = "I postulate it was made by a large tentacle."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.THATCHPACK = "Palm leaves make for an outstanding building material."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.THULECITE = "That captivating dark fuel is concentrated in these stones."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES = "Discharging small packets of dark energy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.THUMPER = "Delivers a pragmatic shock wave of ground reverberations."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRD = "A stunning creature with an unusual command of electrostatic energy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRDNEST = "Those birds appear to be incubating deposits of iron!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.THUNDERHAT = "A lightning rod mere inches from my brain. What an intriguing experiment!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TIDALPOOL = "Theoretically, there are fish within."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TIDAL_PLANT = "Plantlife. Evidently, they're drawn to this climate."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TIGEREYE = "Theoretically, it's edible. But I believe there could be a better use for it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TIGERSHARK = "A spectacular chimera of fish and kitty."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TIGERSHARKSHADOW = "What magnificent mystery could be hiding down there?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT = "An extravagant hat. And one that is affecting my brain waves."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TOPIARY = "Presumably this is a sophisticated monument to local folklore."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TORCH = "Portable combustion. Direly needed in this environment."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN = "How does its unusually tiny neck support such a bulbous beak."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX = "Fascinating. A translucent bag just spontaneously materialized!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR = "A crystal diode made of gold and rocks! I have many uses for this!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRAP = "A rudimentary invention to abduct small creatures."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH = "How magnificently unmerciful!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL = "A revelation in weaponry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET = "What enigmas of the deep can I uncover!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED_GENERIC = "Full of the wonders of the sea!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED_SOON = "Theoretically, it will reach the bottom soon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED_SOONISH = "Descending rapidly..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_BURNT = "No longer functioning."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_GENERIC = "Has a lock, but it does not require a key. Curious."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP = "Evidence would suggest it's more than it appears to be."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP = "Are those trees conspiring against me?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRE_GUARD = "If I could only take such possessed topiaries home with me!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TREE_PILLAR = "The circumference of this tree's trunk is unusually large."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT = "Its incredible effectiveness increases threefold when used in the water!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1 = "Glass blown into spheres and fused together."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10 = "Has someone lost their dental work?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11 = "A rudimentary design, lifeless and uninspiring."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12 = "Marvelous! A severed limb!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13 = "I've never seen such an ingenious opening device on a tin can!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14 = "A stuffed figure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15 = "It produces highly pleasurable longitudinal sound waves."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16 = "I hypothesize this came in through a rift."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17 = "A boot. But who did it belong to?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18 = "The hole prevents it from retaining any liquid."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19 = "A medical experiment I'm reluctant to try."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2 = "A shame it's broken. I enjoy the sound of a thin membrane vibrating in a hollow tube."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20 = "Ah! A reflecting navigation instrument!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21 = "Theoretically, it's seaworthy. But much too small for me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22 = "Was this candle burnt here, or somewhere else?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23 = "Ah. It needs a DR356X001."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3 = "Curious. Some force prevents me from untying it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4 = "How strange. Who would need such things here?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5 = "Marvelous! I would very much like one on a bigger scale."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6 = "Ingenius! Color coding wires would make them easier to distinguish their composition."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7 = "There's a trick to it. I know it!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8 = "I would love to know this got here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9 = "Buttons. But none fit my clothing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_1 = "A stone replication of royalty. Theoretically, it's worth something."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_3 = "A memento of my most enjoyable vacation."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_4 = "Incredible! I suspect this canister contains many surprises."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TROPICALBOUILLABAISSE = "A delicious concoction of water borne animals!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TROPICALFAN = "Fascinating! It controls air currents."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TROPICAL_FISH = "A beautiful fish! But I dare not consume it raw."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER = "Allows for proper air convection."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER = "Allows for proper air conduction."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED = "A parboiled proboscis."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER = "Fascinating! Even its trunk changes color!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER = "It has an extra layer of insulation for the winter time."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUSTY_SHOOTER = "It propels projectiles using the pneumatic potential energy in a bulb horn!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE = "Its resilient husk will require something stronger than an axe."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP = "Strange. It has the faint scent of solanine."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP_COOKED = "Ah, the petals of the corolla are a nice touch."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP = "Given my delicate constitution, I'll refrain from eating it raw."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP_COOKED = "Even the stems are edible when they are cooked."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED = "What mysteries are within that mobile sphere of branches?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN = "What an extraordinary opening device!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TURBINE_BLADES = "Who manufactured this blade? It's quite precise!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TURF_ASH = "Curious. It's mostly ash, yet it will still burn."
