GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_WAXING = "The magic is heightening!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK = "A weapon worthy of Thor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD = "It takes a brave warrior to wield this sword."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NITRE = "It contains explosive components."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.NUBBIN = "No Excalibur juts from its center."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN = "Pebbles from the fire mountain!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANAXE = "Now THIS is an axe!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE = "Throwing fire is the coward's way. But such fun!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_EMBERS = "The fire's nearly dead."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_GENERIC = "A fire fit for a Viking!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_HIGH = "The fire roars!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_LOW = "The fire's slowly dying."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_NORMAL = "Warm fire, warm Wigfrid."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_OUT = "And the light flickers out."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANMACHETE = "A tool for cutting. A tool for burning."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANSPEARGUN = "I normally prefer to set fires up close."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN_WORKBENCH = "Fire forge!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSCHEST = "The chest holds offerings."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSKING = "He seems open to bartering."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OINC = "Njord bestows a gift upon me this day."
