GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OINC100 = "My conquests have been profitable!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND = "Sing with me! We are the guardians of Asgard!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET = "Gathering has never been so easy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM = "A stone of orange."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF = "A staff of magical movement."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.ORGANIC_DOOR = "A door of Yggdrasil."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OX = "Praise Odin for this bountiful hoofed feast!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OXHAT = "This helm will keep my scalp dry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE = "I have no rhythm..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN = "Ah, a fine mug it would make!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PACKIM = "Will you follow me to Valhalla?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PACKIM_FISHBONE = "A curious bauble."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF = "A Viking-sized leaf!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_HUT = "Keeps the rain off my helm."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_UMBRELLA = "I dislike plants, but I dislike wet armor more."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_BURNING = "The wood's ablaze!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_BURNT = "Loge took that one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_CHOPPED = "Chopped by the warrior of the woods!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_GENERIC = "Do you forsake branches, tree?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_BURNT = "I smell burnt coconut."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_STUMP = "You will be fueling my hearth in Valhalla."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST = "It contains a mystery."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE = "I prefer to face my enemies awake."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PANGOLDEN = "Surely a cousin of Gullinbursti!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS = "This will carry forth the record of my saga."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PARROT = "Hold your tongue, bird!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE_DEAD = "It has joined Valhalla's choir invisible."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE_GENERIC = "A Norwegian bird of blue."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE_SLEEPING = "Pining for Njord."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PARROT_PIRATE = "You talk too much!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEACOCK = "It will be a shame to ruin those feathers, meat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_DEAD = "Even in death its eyes stare into my soul."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_GENERIC = "It has the eyes of Odin."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_SLEEPING = "I cannot tell if it is awake or sleep."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWKFEATHER = "A priceless beauty."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWKFEATHERHAT = "Deceit is the tactic of cowards."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWKFEATHER_PRISM = "The visage of the Bifrost!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_BUSH = "Do you think you can hide from me?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEDESTAL_KEY = "A key for which to open treasures."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN_DEAD = "It has met its end."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN_GENERIC = "Blessed am I by this creature's sight."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN_SLEEPING = "It has fallen into a dream."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEG_LEG = "This leg will make a fine basher!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN = "Birds of the sea, come from afar."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PERD = "You cannot run forever!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES = "Pockets of meat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PETALS = "Thank you Froh for this gift!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL = "These were not made by Froh."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PHEROMONESTONE = "A stone of magic language."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM = "The secretions of a terrible beast!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE = "I can use it to get precious spear and helm materials."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGBANDIT = "Touch not my gold!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGCROWNHAT = "Power gifted by the gods."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGEON_DEAD = "It has been bested in battle!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGEON_GENERIC = "Be you tasty?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGEON_SLEEPING = "Sleep has been victorious!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGGHOST = "A beast spirit."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PI_GUARD = "He's battle ready, I can tell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK = "The pig died with honor, then gave to me this pack."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD_BURNT = "Normally I like a good roast, but this is not right."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD_GENERIC = "This is savagery."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_BURNT = "Loge did not smile upon you this day."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FULL = "Come out and go to war with me!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_GENERIC = "I did not think pigs could make houses."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_LIGHTSOUT = "Do you not hunger for battle, pig?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY_BURNING = "Aflame with the fires of Hel!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY_GENERIC = "A village home worthy of a shield maiden's protection."
