GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM_GENERIC = "Farming was not my life's calling."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE_BURNING = "Hel's fire consumes it!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE_GENERIC = "A house for Dwarfish things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGKING = "Is it pig-Odin?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_DEAD = "He died with honor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FOLLOWER = "We ride to battle!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_GENERIC = "Will you fight alongside me, pig?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_GUARD = "That pig looks brave."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_WEREPIG = "It has been tainted by Fenrir."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER_GENERIC = "Another beast of the coin!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER_SLEEPING = "I wish him nightmares!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN_GENERIC = "She hath need of feathers."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN_SLEEPING = "She conquers beauty sleep."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_COLLECTOR_GENERIC = "Your wonders are nothing compared to Valhalla!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_COLLECTOR_SLEEPING = "Goda nott!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE_GENERIC = "He deals in the black arts."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE_SLEEPING = "May his nightmares consume him."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FARMER_GENERIC = "Your time is better spent on the fruits of the hunt, pig!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FARMER_SLEEPING = "May his dreams show him the errors of his craft!"
