GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST_PICKED = "A young bird of war will soon be born."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TAR = "Surely a substance of pure evil."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TARLAMP = "A light to guide mine longship!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TARSUIT = "This shall repel Aegir's clammy touch."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR_LOWFUEL = "The machine shall not hold much longer."
