GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_POTATO = "A strange thing, indeed!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_RING = "A ring worthy of a Giant."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO = "No decency. It's not even metal meat."
