GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE = "It looks fierce. Into the fray!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE = "Gooey, but dangerous. I like it."
