GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM_PICKED = "Another time, maybe?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BLUNDERBUSS = "A weapon after my own heart."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BOARDS = "Roughly hewn."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BOAT = "It's not going anywhere."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BOATCANNON = "It's about time I got my hands on one of these."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BOATREPAIRKIT = "It will hold off my vessel's inevitable decay."
