GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BUGREPELLENT = "This will put that horde in its place."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE = "Nice and snug."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP = "I guess we could wrap a few things up."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN = "It reminds me of my old act."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BUOY = "It floats with ease."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BURIEDTREASURE = "Ah, what's this then?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BURR = "A tenacious seed."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BURR_SAPLING = "I'm sure I have a use for this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT = "There's room in there for me."
