GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER_SLEEPING = "Dormancy becomes it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT = "Such quality workmanship!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHTBOAT = "Obey me, fool!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE = "It looks beyond repair."
