GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOTSAM = "I can't quite reach it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER = "They are bright and cheery. Yuck."
