GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUG_HOOFPRINT = "Ornamentation is pointless."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUG_METAL = "Hard. Like life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUG_NAILBED = "Does nothing to reassure me."
