GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUG_RECTANGLE = "Ornamentation is pointless."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUG_ROUND = "Does nothing to reassure me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUG_RUBBERMAT = "Ornamentation is pointless."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUG_SQUARE = "Ornamentation is pointless."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUG_SWIRL = "Ornamentation is pointless."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUG_TILES = "Ornamentation is pointless."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUG_WEB = "Does nothing to reassure me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUG_WORMHOLE = "Does nothing to reassure me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT = "Abigail would've loved this crown."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT = "I hold the power of the ancients in my hands."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE = "A pile of broken dreams."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN = "I'm only taking back what's mine."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC = "As if it wasn't already burdened by the yoke of life..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE = "Too much whimsy gives me indigestion."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR = "Oh, how we bend creatures to our ill intent."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAIL = "Harness the wind and fly to... nowhere."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAIL_STICK = "It's... a stick."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK = "The beasts crave it..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAND = "I wonder if the sand knows of its own insignificance?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANDBAG = "They hold back ruin. For a time..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL = "Dense and heavy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL_ITEM = "A bag of dirt I can carry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANDBAG_ITEM = "Looks like a back injury waiting to happen."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANDHILL = "This looks impermanent."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAND_CASTLE_GENERIC = "Its beauty will undoubtedly succumb to the tide."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAND_CASTLE_SAND = "If only molding the sands of time were so easy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK_ACTIVE = "It's calling to me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK_INACTIVE = "Even this obelisk has left me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING_BURNING = "Consigned to the flames."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING_GENERIC = "It's trying to grow up."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING_PICKED = "Maybe next time, sapling."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SAPLING_WITHERED = "The oppressive heat got to this one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON = "The flame has cleansed this poor wretched soul."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCORPION_DEAD = "You had no purpose in life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCORPION_GENERIC = "One sting and it could be over."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SCORPION_SLEEPING = "I wish you horrid nightmares."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO = "A sea once teeming with life. No more."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL = "The scavengers of land and sea."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL_WATER = "As if it weren't bad enough that they foul the air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEASACK = "It slows the rot and decay."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL = "Whatever used to live in this is probably dead now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL_BEACHED = "She sells seashells... oh, what's the point."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEATRAP = "Come, creatures of the sea! Enjoy a lovely snack!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED = "Even the sea is infested by weeds."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_COOKED = "Better, but it's still a weed."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_DRIED = "It keeps longer like this. Tastes better too."
