GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_OBSIDIAN = "Jabbing with fire."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_POISON = "One jab and they'll be retching."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR = "It seems a tad dramatic."
