GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH = "This fish cuts death with its face!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TAFFY = "Never imagined I could make a thing so sweet."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD = "Free from the shackles of the sky."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG = "So full of potential."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED = "All that promise, snatched away. Not bad with bacon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED_COLD = "Chilled by the darkness."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED_GENERIC = "A tiny, fragile being, struggling for the light."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED_HOT = "It cannot bear the heat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED_LONG = "A life sooner begun is a life sooner ended."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED_SHORT = "Soon now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST_GENERIC = "That egg represents a new life. Ugh."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST_PICKED = "The nest is empty. Vacant. Barren. A void."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TAR = "Thick, with a stench of corruption."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TARLAMP = "It takes vileness and makes it light."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TARSUIT = "To make my outside match my inside."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR_LOWFUEL = "It won't last much longer. Me neither."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR_OFF = "It's off..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR_ON = "It is pulling sludge from the depths."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TAR_POOL = "Corruption oozes from beneath."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TAR_TRAP = "A recipe for a slow painful death."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEA = "Abigail loved tea parties."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEATREE = "I can sit under it and contemplate life's futility."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT = "Makes life barely more livable in allergy season."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_NUT_COOKED = "I killed it to prolong my own life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEATREE_SAPLING = "Ah, to be young and full of promise."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD_GENERIC = "Will you leave me too?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD_HUNGRY = "We all try to fill the void."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD_STARVING = "Your true nature is revealed!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE_GEMS = "The focus is so lifeless."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE_VALID = "Energy flows through it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEBRELLA = "Momentarily relieves my weariness."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_ACTIVE = "I'm sure the next realm will be even more horrible!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_GENERIC = "No good can come of this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_LOCKED = "It's still locked shut."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_PARTIAL = "Is it half built, or half destroyed?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX = "It contains a vital spark."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK = "It looks complicated."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_BASE = "It feels incomplete. Like life without Abigail."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_BOX = "Has the look of something lost to time."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_CRANK = "Can only lead to trouble."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_POTATO = "It speaks to our soul."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_RING = "The piece of a horrible whole."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO = "What a hideous creation!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING = "It has no sharp edges."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BASE = "It's missing something."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BOX = "Looks a little screwy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_CRANK = "It seems incomplete."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_POTATO = "What possible use could this have?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_RING = "This ring's probably not for wearing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELESCOPE = "To peer over the horizon with an unabiding longing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF = "I could escape if it were more powerful."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TELIPAD = "It can retreive me from the aether."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENT_BURNT = "A preview of the fires of Hell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENT_GENERIC = "Sleep is but a preview of death."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE = "Long, thin and dangerous!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE = "Sharp, slimy and dangerous."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS = "These are better left unmentioned."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN = "This one is different."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR = "So this is what goes on down below."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM = "Babies!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE = "It shall return, some day."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THATCHPACK = "I was always destined to carry a heavy load."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THULECITE = "Its presence marks the edge of the unknown."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES = "Fragments of a powerful material."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THUMPER = "Cold-hearted metallic destruction."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRD = "It could strike me down."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THUNDERBIRDNEST = "It may comfort something but it doesn't comfort me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.THUNDERHAT = "Pretty."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TIDALPOOL = "When I gaze into this limpid pool I dream I can see Abigail."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TIDAL_PLANT = "It's sharp."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TIGEREYE = "Tyger, tyger, burning bright..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TIGERSHARK = "Orange striped death on water!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TIGERSHARKSHADOW = "Peril!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT = "A piece of finery to help forget the inescapable wild."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOPIARY = "It lends a false air of civility."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TORCH = "A tiny bulwark against the night."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TORNADO = "Nature's ravenous wrath!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN = "It sings a tortured song."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX = "A handful of sustenance."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR = "Electrical doo-what?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAP = "Simple grass has become deadly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH = "A devious surprise from underground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL = "Death when I least expect it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET = "A way to wrest items from the sea's grip."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED_GENERIC = "What creatures will this wrest from the ocean?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED_SOON = "Its journey is almost at an end."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED_SOONISH = "It's started its journey into the depths."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_BURNT = "It couldn't even hold ashes."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_GENERIC = "For which to contain my lucre."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP = "Every once in awhile, things go my way."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP = "Was this placed intentionally?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRE_GUARD = "Oh... no..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TREE_PILLAR = "Ancient, and full of life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT = "The peoples that forged this are long dead."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1 = "Perfectly misshapen."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10 = "Another mouth to feed."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11 = "Lucky robot, it never had a soul."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12 = "Not so slimy any more, are we?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13 = "Maybe if I drank this stuff I'd return to my sister."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14 = "If I pushed a pin into this doll, who would feel it?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15 = "Whoever this belonged to isn't walking anymore."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16 = "Whatever this belonged to met a bad end."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17 = "Whoever wore this is surely dead."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18 = "A remnant of a civilization lost at sea."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19 = "The owner's brain has surely clouded for good by now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2 = "It's a fake. Just a temptation, like death."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20 = "I just use it as a paperweight."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21 = "What sort of simple mind would be amused by this?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22 = "Very DIY."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23 = "How unfortunate."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3 = "If only knives solved more of my problems..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4 = "I'd carry this to the end of the world."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5 = "I'd fly this straight into the sun, if only it was bigger."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6 = "Once alive with electricity, they've met their end."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7 = "Just a simple game."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8 = "I wish I could take a bath."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9 = "Mismatched buttons for a mismatched life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_1 = "A tribute to life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_3 = "Wish I wasn't here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_4 = "I can no longer be amused by childish things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TROPICALBOUILLABAISSE = "A brief respite from the hunger."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TROPICALFAN = "When I am still, it is as lifeless as Abigail."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TROPICAL_FISH = "It's offensively bright."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER = "Skin to wear on my skin."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER = "It may warm my body, but what of my spirit?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED = "It looks even worse now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER = "I would have preferred the ears."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER = "Separated from its only friend."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUSTY_SHOOTER = "A small instrument of tiny destruction."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE = "An axe won't kill it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP = "Pretty flower."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP_COOKED = "Should I eat the flower too?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP = "Will I be dead before it ripens?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP_COOKED = "Perhaps I'm lucky and it's still poisoned."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED = "Alone and rolling through life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN = "This is plainly false advertising."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURBINE_BLADES = "No longer turning."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_ASH = "It's just ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS = "Some ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEACH = "Sand does not make good grave fill."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_HAIR = "Some ground."
