GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_SINKHOLE = "Some ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_SNAKESKINFLOOR = "It's just ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_SWAMP = "It's just ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_TIDALMARSH = "It's just ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK = "Some ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_VOLCANO = "It's just ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR = "Some ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER = "Who's gobbling now?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TWIGS = "Plucked from the ground before their prime."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TWISTER = "Nature is very angry!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TWISTER_SEAL = "It has no awareness of the ills of this world."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA = "The clouds weep."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.UNAGI = "It looks more appetizing this way."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED = "It's not done, like life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT_DEAD = "Now you may kill no more."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT_GENERIC = "Take my heart's blood, I've no use for it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT_SLEEPING = "I wish you nightmares."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE = "The maw of death itself."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BAT_WING = "If only I could fly away."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND = "Their dead drop the cure to their sickness."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK = "Objects from a dead thing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VINE = "Unruly life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO = "The mountain that spews death to the heavens!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VOLCANOSTAFF = "The fiery breath of the volcano is mine to command!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR_GENERIC = "It's closed for business."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR_OPEN = "Let the sacrifice begin!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR_BROKEN = "Shame. No more weapons of fire to forge."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR_TOWER = "A beautiful altar of death."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_EXIT = "Shall I leave this place of hot death?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB = "A wretched shadow of its former self."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES = "They're definitely waffles."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALKINGSTICK = "For walking this weary world."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALLCRACK_RUINS = "Life is an endless enigma."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALLYINTRO_DEBRIS = "The ship has been obliterated."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE = "Slimy on top."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE_ITEM = "It would be more useful if I placed it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_BURNT = "Defenses down."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_GENERIC = "That is a mere suggestion of defense."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM = "Their defensive value is questionable."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE = "A wall of the dead to beat back the living."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE_ITEM = "A wall made of living coral... No longer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK = "The moon... she whispers promises of protection to me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM = "This gift from above should not go to waste."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS = "A wall."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS = "These didn't protect the ancients did they!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM = "Are the very stones haunted?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE = "What will protect me from what's inside?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM = "These won't protect from the demons within."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_BURNT = "The inevitable is coming."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_GENERIC = "Now I can delay the inevitable."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM = "Bundled logs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS = "An old man of the sea."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT = "What feverish thoughts transpired beneath this?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP_EMPTY = "If they are not in there, where are they?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP_GENERIC = "This home is not a happy one, I fear."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK = "I gnash thee."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE_BURNING = "Soon it will be nothing but ashes."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE_BURNT = "Now it doesn't remind me of anything."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE_GENERIC = "It reminds me of a story I used to read with Abigail."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WARG = "A true bastion of evil."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE = "They hide in their fortress of hate."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WATERCHEST = "Treasures suspended over the bottomless abyss."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WATERCROCODOG = "A damp death awaits me..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WATERDROP = "A drop of life in this bleak existence."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON = "It's mostly water. What's the big deal?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT = "It's sticky on my head. Yuck."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE = "The melon is in stasis."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED = "Now it's warm water."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS = "Perfectly shaped for spitting."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WATERYGRAVE = "I'm not above raiding a grave for loot."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER = "It feels so... nostalgic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL = "Do you want me to read you a story, Abigail?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL = "He's better this way."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE = "Its sole existence is to annoy me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE = "Bits of bug carcass."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP = "A miserable mess, just like life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BLUE = "It looks sad."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BUBBLES = "Looks like a fish with a gas problem."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_BLUE = "Something this big and dead will surely stink."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_WHITE = "It is very big. And very dead."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WHALE_TRACK = "Whale, ho!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WHALE_WHITE = "There is the hate of life burning in its eyes!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WHEELER_TRACKER = "Can it find happiness?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WHIP = "It only provides the illusion of control."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_CROWN = "Monarchs must have tiny heads."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_UNLOCK = "His finery does nothing to mask the smell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WILDBORE = "What's it got to be angry about?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHEAD = "What lovely decor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHOUSE = "Hopefully they won't invite me in."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_GREENHOUSE = "I prefer the dark and windowless depths of my soul."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE = "A reminder of the outside."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN = "A reminder of the outside."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND = "A cold harsh way to see the outside world."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_BURLAP = "A reminder of the outside."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_CURTAINS_NAILS = "A reminder of the outside."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_SMALL_PEAKED = "A reminder of the outside."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_SMALL_PEAKED_CURTAIN = "A reminder of the outside."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_TALL = "A reminder of the outside."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_TALL_CURTAIN = "A reminder of the outside."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WIND_CONCH = "A terrifying force of nature contained within a delicate shell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT = "It helps stave off the encroaching cold."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER_BURNT = "Does that mean my day to die is here?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER_GENERIC = "Why do I feel that it is measuring my mortality?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSBOAT = "A seaworthy vessel if ever there was one!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT = "Haughty seadog couture."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSSAIL = "I adore the design."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE = "At least his soul escaped."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY1 = "What unfortunate soul donated their bones for this?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2 = "It probably unlocks something fancy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY3 = "What do you open?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WOOD_DOOR = "Only leads to disappointment."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM_DIRT = "Is something there?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM_PLANT = "It seems out of place."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORM_WORM = "It comes from the depths."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_GENERIC = "Life doesn't always make sense."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_OPEN = "No matter what it consumes, it is never satisfied."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED = "It's looking downtrodden."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT = "There's a slight humming coming from it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER = "Better the worm's light than its tongue."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT = "It seems out of place."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.WRECK = "Its crew is probably dead..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET = "A brief light in my dark life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM = "It reminds me of my mother."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF = "The stick is as twisted as my soul."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ZEB_DEAD = "Say hello to my sweet sister."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ZEB_GENERIC = "They are free and wild."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.ZEB_SLEEPING = "I wish I could escape my horrors so easily."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.GENERIC = "It is unmentionable."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MYSTERY = "Something cryptic lingers here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.NEARSIGHTED = "This is what the world looks like when I'm crying."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SMOLDERING = "Soon to be swallowed by flames."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOODARK = "The darkness! It is too dark!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER_GENERIC = "A totally normal flower. Yeah. That's what it is."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER_HAUNTED_GROUND = "Is there some kind of magic trick to it?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER_HAUNTED_POCKET = "It's trying to get out. Understandable."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER_LONG = "A budding flower. How nice."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER_MEDIUM = "Not sure I've seen that kind of flower around here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER_SOON = "It's ready for something."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE = "Why would I do this? Because it's there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ACORN_GENERIC = "Looks like a projectile to me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ACORN_PLANTED = "It's a stick. I'm not going to get all sentimental about it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED = "Nothing like the smell of roasted nuts."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ADULT_FLYTRAP_DEAD = "I'm not going to cry over that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ADULT_FLYTRAP_GENERIC = "Excuse me while I avoid you entirely."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ADULT_FLYTRAP_SLEEPING = "Sleeping on the job. Not that I have a problem with that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL = "Smells like adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.AERODYNAMICHAT = "I wonder if this would work on my balloon too."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ALLOY = "Heavy metal made heavier."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ALOE = "Low cost medicine."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_COOKED = "I cooked away some of the medication."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_PLANTED = "I'll take that, thank you very much."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ALOE_SEEDS = "I could grow something. Or I could launch something."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.AMULET = "Now I can have two lifetimes of adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN = "Now, what would repair this thing?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.WORKING = "Looks like an ancient knowledge kind of thing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN = "Now, what would repair this thing?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HERALD = "You must be a riot at parties."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HULK = "I probably should have let you sleep."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_REMNANT = "Swell. Ripped clothes from that creepy thing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ROBOTS_ASSEMBLY = "How much am I going to regret putting that all together?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ROBOT_CLAW = "Where's the rest of you?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ROBOT_HEAD = "Are you aware you're missing the rest of your body?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ROBOT_LEG = "Well, it's better facing two left feet."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ROBOT_RIBS = "I like it better when it's not awake."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE = "It looks... old."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK = "Ohh! A mystery!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTCHEST = "I need the storage space, but I want the honey."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTCOMBHOME = "Full of bundled up big baby bugs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTHILL = "Can't get more adventurous then going into a giant insect nest."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTIVENOM = "A cure for too much adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTLER = "Maybe this bird whistle will convince a bird to fly me out of here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTMAN_DEAD = "I won't step on it out of respect."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTMAN_GENERIC = "Travel. See the world. Meet some interesting insects."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTMAN_SLEEPING = "I'll just sneak on by."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTMAN_WARRIOR = "Swell. This one's angry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTMAN_WARRIOR_EGG = "Better get dodging, Wheeler."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTMASKHAT = "Swell. Now I know what it smells like to be an insect."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTQUEEN = "Ma'am, this is no way to treat a guest!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTQUEEN_CHAMBERS = "I can never say no to an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTQUEEN_THRONE = "I bet she was guarding some kind of treasure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANTSUIT = "All dressed up and ready to cr'kit."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ANT_CAVE_LANTERN = "Oh good. That keeps my hands free."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.APORKALYPSE_CLOCK = "If only I could turn time back to before I crashed here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMORCACTUS = "All the rage with the dangerous vegetation crowd."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY = "Some kind of fancy flight suit."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS = "Because everyone knows grass is nigh on impenetrable."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMORLIMESTONE = "It's heavier than the sandbags on my balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE = "It's like wearing a tank. Like driving a tank too."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMOROBSIDIAN = "I feel like I'm wearing a volcano."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS = "Ready for whatever adventures come my way."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMORSEASHELL = "She wears seashells by the seashore."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER = "It'll be all the rage in Paris."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL = "You never really know a snail until you slink a mile in its shell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMORVORTEXCLOAK = "A deep dark hole full of storage space."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD = "I think it brings out the color in my eyes."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LIFEJACKET = "It's like a parachute for a boat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_METALPLATE = "Oof. It's heavier than ballast."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY = "Looks... safe?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SNAKESKIN = "I'll leave this one for a rainy day."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_WEEVOLE = "If only it had those bug wings."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_WINDBREAKER = "I'll never get blown off course with this jacket."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ARMOUREDBOAT = "Nothing will get past these strategically placed seashells!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ASH_GENERIC = "Swell. It's been burnt to ash."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE = "I'm guessing it doesn't work anymore."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER = "Well, hopefully there's another one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE = "I don't suppose I could put it back together."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS = "I always eat my vegetables. Or launch them out the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP = "Watery vegetables. Mmmm... mmmm!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED = "Smells surprisingly good."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_PLANTED = "That looks like food! Let's hope it tastes like food."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS = "To shove in the ground or launch through the air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.AXE = "If a tree falls in the forest, it was probably from an axe."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO_GENERIC = "Aw. So cute and smelly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO_SLEEPING = "Even cuter and smellier when they're asleep."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BABYOX = "Aw, he's so cute and waterlogged!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK = "Finally! My pockets were getting full."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS = "Not often I get a breakfast like this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY = "Too bad they weren't 100 times bigger and attached to a basket."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BALLPEIN_HAMMER = "So cute and convenient."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BALLPHIN = "Well \"Eek Eek\" to you too."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BALLPHINHOUSE = "Did they build that with their fins?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BALLPHINPOD = "There's a party going on and I wasn't invited!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BAMBOO = "One piece is nice. Many pieces are nicer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE_BURNT = "Well, that's one way to get bamboo out of your garden."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE_CHOPPED = "Bamboo. The only thing more tenacious than me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE_GENERIC = "Swell. It's a bunch of sticks."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP = "Banana. Stick. Ice. What more do you need?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE = "Looks like it will... work?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BANDITHAT = "An adventuring hat, if I've ever seen one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BANDITMAP = "Time to burgle from the burglar."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BANDITTREASURE = "If you're going to hide a treasure, don't put a fancy feather on it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BASALT = "It's stronger than my will to break it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BASEFAN = "A plane propeller would be better."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BAT = "I was never that angry when I was flying."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BATBAT = "Aw. I was hoping it would let me fly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BATHAT = "Aw... It doesn't even let me fly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BATWING = "Maybe if I flapped it really fast I could get off the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED = "Swell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BAT_HIDE = "Hmmm... never noticed those bats had a springy tail."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR = "Swell. I always wanted a bunch of scratchy hair."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEARGER = "If I was looking for trouble, I just found it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST = "I'll call it my \"Wintertime Adventure Vest\"."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR = "Nice thick fur."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY = "I bet I'll dream of bunnies."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW = "I'm thinking its good for one, maybe two, dreams."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEE_GENERIC = "Flying is wasted on insects."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEE_HELD = "I'm surprised it doesn't sting me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_BURNT = "Smells like honey roasted wood."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY = "Brimming with stickiness."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_GENERIC = "A box of honey just waiting to happen."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY = "Come on, bees. You can do it!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY = "Oh, honey!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY = "Just a touch of honey in there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED = "You and I could definitely get into some trouble."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_FOLLOWER = "You look like you're up for an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GENERIC = "Makes fine wool. And even finer manure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED = "Aw. Someone should knit it a coat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY = "Having a bad day. Having a bad hair day too."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY = "I'm sure he can walk it off."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER = "Now I only have to teach it to fly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_SLEEPING = "I bet I could shave it right now and it wouldn't even notice."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT = "It's all the rage with my beefalo friends."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL = "A woolly projectile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT = "I'm wearing this the next time I go out on the town."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE = "I like it better when it's making me honey."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE = "If those bees were nicer to me, I might feel sorry for them."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL = "Swell. Someone's trying to kill me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX = "Aww... Those bees made it just for me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BELL = "I could ring it. That'd be fun."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BELL_BLUEPRINT = "That's about the most interesting bell I've ever seen."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BERMUDATRIANGLE = "An equalateral adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BERRIES = "Juicy little projectiles."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED = "They may be squishy but they'll still fly through the air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_BARREN = "Needs a manure-ing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_GENERIC = "Aww... Are all those berries for me?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_PICKED = "It's missing something... Oh yeah, berries!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_WITHERED = "Cold enough for you? Obviously not."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH2_SNAKE = "Mmmm... leaf berries. Looks delicious."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_SNAKE = "Mmmm... leaf berries. Looks delicious."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIGFISHINGROD = "There's always a bigger fishing rod."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT = "I can't even see this guy's head, he's so big."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BILL_DEAD = "Spun himself to death."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BILL_GENERIC = "Excuse me while I avoid your quills."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BILL_SLEEPING = "Stay asleep so I can get that lotus flower."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BILL_QUILL = "You could poke someone's eye out with this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIOLUMINESCENCE = "Seaborne glowing stuff!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE = "Well, I wanted to see something new."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE_DEAD = "(sigh) I never could keep pets."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE_GENERIC = "I know how it feels to be grounded."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE_HUNGRY = "He's peckish. I can tell because he's pecking."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED = "I'll let you out if you fly me away from here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON = "Someone should clean that out. Unfortunately, that someone has to be me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE_SLEEPING = "Sleep well and dream of clouds."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE_STARVING = "Looks like he could eat a horse. I don't have a horse."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP = "It keeps the little birdies grounded."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG = "Perfectly projectile shaped."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED = "Drat. I was trying to make scrambled eggs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BISHOP = "I'm not in the mood to play games, mister!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT = "Knock it off!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE = "Looks like he's been playing Full Contact Chess?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BISQUE = "Easy to make and easier to eat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE = "Oh! A rival projectile launcher."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FLUP = "Hmmm... should I use my Pew-matic or this weird eyeball blowdart?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE = "You mean I have to blow into it myself?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_POISON = "I prefer to use my horn. On the other hand, who can say no to poison."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP = "This one's so boring it puts things to sleep."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLUBBER = "Swell. Just what every gal needs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLUBBERSUIT = "Every adventure has a low point. This may be it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET = "Keeps me cold-hearted."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM = "Ohh. Sparkly. I like sparkly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT = "Wish it was plans for a new flying machine."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP = "Well if it's not edible, I can always launch it through the air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED = "Only one way to tell if it's safe or not."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM_GENERIC = "I never know which ones are dangerous and which ones are safe."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM_INGROUND = "Found you!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM_PICKED = "Who goes around picking strange mushrooms? Besides me, I mean."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BLUNDERBUSS = "I still like my Pew-matic more."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOARDS = "I'd be board too, if I just lay around all day."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOAT = "It's like a hot air balloon for the water."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOATCANNON = "A Pew-matic for my boat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOATREPAIRKIT = "Swell. Because cork is known for its durability."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LANTERN = "I could've used one of these for my balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOAT_TORCH = "Open fire on a wooden boat. The most adventurous thing I've ever done."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD = "Who knew bone shards would be so useful?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BONESTAFF = "Look into its eye..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW = "If I don't like it, I can always use it as ammo."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS = "Will it help me get back in the air?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE = "Feel good story of the year."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING = "I'm not digging this one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP = "A sleeper hit."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES = "I'm guessing it's not a children's book."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG = "If you love something set it free. If it comes back it's probably a boomerang."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOTTLELANTERN = "I'm sure they love it in there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BRAINJELLYHAT = "If it really made me smarter, I could figure out how it worked."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BRAMBLESPIKE = "It's never easy, is it?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BRAMBLE_BULB = "A lot of work just to get a seed I can't plant."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BRAMBLE_CORE = "I know a valuable thing when I see it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BRUSH = "Not my idea of a good hair brush but those beefalo seem to like it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUGNET = "I'll teach those bugs to flaunt their flying around me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUGREPELLENT = "This'll keep those tiny flyers grounded."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE = "Extra storage space!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP = "Wrapped up extra tight so it'll fit in my pocket."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN = "Yeah, that's not creepy at all."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUOY = "Tiny little floating lighthouses."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BURIEDTREASURE = "A chest of adventure buried under the ground!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BURR = "This would look good coming out of the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BURR_SAPLING_BURNING = "Fact: wood is flammable."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BURR_SAPLING_GENERIC = "Swell. Another tree."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BURR_SAPLING_PICKED = "Need to wait a few days for it to grow back."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BURR_SAPLING_WITHERED = "What do I look like, some kind of gardener?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT = "Good thing this is a great disguise, because I don't want to be seen wearing it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE_BURNT = "Not unexpected."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE_CHOPPED = "It'll grow back. I hope."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE_GENERIC = "Look at all those ropey branches just waiting to be used."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUTTER = "Practically screaming to be launched through the air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY_GENERIC = "It's more a flutterer than a flyer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY_HELD = "Tell me all your flying secrets."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN = "Swell. It comes with butterfly frosting."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS = "If I launch it with my Pew-matic, will it start fluttering again?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD = "Nice wings. Wanna give me a ride?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_GENERIC = "It's almost like it doesn't want to be eaten."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_PICKED = "I'd be okay if it didn't grow back."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER = "A nice flowery projectile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT = "Still a little prickly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED = "Bottom's up!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL = "Little bits of projectile, all wrapped up for me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE_EMBERS = "It has a glow about it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE_GENERIC = "I know a thing or two about hot air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE_HIGH = "That's a lot of hot air!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE_LOW = "Needs something... It needs to not go out!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE_NORMAL = "Put a balloon over that and I'm airborne again!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE_OUT = "Swell. At least I got some ash out of the whole thing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CANDLEHAT = "Swell. I feel completely safe with an open flame on my head."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CANE = "An efficient way to adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CANNONSHOT = "It's a big Pew-matic just waiting to be fired."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAPTAINHAT = "Now I'm almost as good a sea captain as I am an aeronaut."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CARGOBOAT = "Now all my things can go adventuring with me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CARROT = "Makes for an aerodynamic projectile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED = "It's already cut up into tiny little projectiles for me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED = "A wild vegetable in its natural habitat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS = "I could plant it. I could also fire it out my Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CATCOON = "Cats make better pets than dogs. It's a fact."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN_EMPTY = "Nothing but stump."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN_GENERIC = "With all that yarn, there must be knitter inside."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT = "It's like walking around with a cat on my head."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA = "Ever see a fruit fly?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT = "You pick a fight with fire, you always lose."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED = "Swell. I made baby food."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE = "Aw, that's sweet. It grew those bananas just for me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE = "My Grandma taught me to always look under rocks."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN_GENERIC = "I'm going to leave it, for now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN_OPEN = "I'm not one to reject an invitation like that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS = "Smells like trouble. I like trouble."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT_GENERIC = "Why would I want to leave?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT_OPEN = "It's a way out."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT_ROC = "Time to get back to 'reality'."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN = "That says projectile to me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CAVIAR = "If I don't like it, it's going in the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE = "If I don't like it, I can always use it for ammo."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL = "Chopped up projectile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1 = "I said I wanted to see something new. That's definitely something new."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2 = "I don't know who made it, but it's unmade now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3 = "Doesn't look like flying machine, so why should I fix it?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHESTER = "I would've named you \"Pockets\"."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE_GENERIC = "It's missing an eye. And everything else."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING = "Well, at least someone can sleep."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHICKEN_DEAD = "I promise I will go on without you!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHICKEN_GENERIC = "Can't fly. But then neither can I now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHICKEN_SLEEPING = "Probably dreaming he was a flying bird."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHIMINEA = "A nice cozy place for a nice cozy fire."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CHITIN = "I'm going to need more of these."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CIRCLINGSEAGULL = "Show off."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CITY_HAMMER = "Nobody will mind if I just knock a few buildings down."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CITY_LAMP_GENERIC = "A free light source. I'll take it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CITY_LAMP_ON = "Not much to look at now, but wait'll nighttime."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CLAWPALMTREE = "Strange kind of wood it's got there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CLAWPALMTREE_SAPLING = "You better be worth the effort."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CLIPPINGS = "Swell. A handful of leaves. Maybe someone will want them."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CLOTHSAIL = "Nice cloth. It makes good material for a hot air balloon too."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COCONADE_BURNING = "Now is not the time for a closer examination."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COCONADE_GENERIC = "Bad news: It doesn't fit the Pew-matic. Good news: It doesn't have to."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_GENERIC = "A tough coconut to crack"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_PLANTED = "Coconutty little guy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_COOKED = "Looks good. It'd look better flying from the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_HALVED = "It fits into the Pew-matic now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COFFEE = "Because there's no better time to be jumpy than when you're on an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS = "Small enough to fit in the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS_COOKED = "I eat these all the time during overnight flights."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBOT = "Automatic coffee maker, what will they think of next?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH_BARREN = "Longs for the nourishing effects of poop."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH_GENERIC = "I've learned never to turn down a free coffee."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH_PICKED = "I need coffee so I can deal with the fact that I can't have coffee."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH_WITHERED = "Unlike me, it's very particular about where it lives."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE_EMBERS = "Quick, add fuel before it gets warm!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE_GENERIC = "A cold fire! I wonder if it still makes balloons rise."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE_HIGH = "Woohoo! I'm getting cold under the collar!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE_LOW = "Better add some fuel before it warms up."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE_NORMAL = "Much better than the summer campfires I had when I was a kid."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE_OUT = "Well, it was interesting while it lasted."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT_EMBERS = "Quick, add fuel before it gets warm!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT_GENERIC = "A cold fire! I wonder if it still makes balloons rise."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT_HIGH = "Woohoo! I'm getting cold under the collar!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT_LOW = "Better add some fuel before it warms up."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT_NORMAL = "Much better than the summer campfires when I was a kid."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT_OUT = "Throw some fuel in there and it'll start right up again."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E = "East."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COMPASS_GENERIC = "Mine's better."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N = "North."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE = "Northeast."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW = "Northwest."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S = "South."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE = "Southeast."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW = "Southwest."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W = "West."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PERMIT = "Now I can have one room to live in, and one room for all my things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE = "That took a lot out of me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT = "Meat on a bone to put a little meat on your bones."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT = "I like my monster meat medium roar."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT = "The snacking meat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT_BURNT = "No one ever accused me of being a good cook."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG = "Hope I don't die of hunger while I wait."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT = "It'll be done in short order."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT_DONE = "Through the teeth, past the gums..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT_EMPTY = "Meals are typically better if they contain food."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL = "Heads or tails? I pick tails."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORAL = "I need to find more of them."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORALLARVE = "Just because it's small, doesn't mean it's cute."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORALREEF = "Really goes out of its way to be an obstacle, doesn't it?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN = "What'cha thinking?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN_ROCK = "Sure it has a bigger brain than me, but I have the bigger heart."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORK = "A light material but not sturdy enough to make a balloon with."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORKBOAT = "About as stable as a cork balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORKCHEST = "Pretty small but I'm desperate for storage space."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORK_BAT = "Time for all that stick ball playing to come in handy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORMORANT = "Maybe it'll teach me how to fly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORN = "Aerodynamic food."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED = "Makes for a crackerjack projectile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS = "A seed for a vegetable made of seeds."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CRAB_GENERIC = "Be a dear and stay right there so I can catch you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CRAB_HIDDEN = "Those crabbits are experts at hide-and-seek."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CRABHOLE = "You're not fooling anyone hiding underground like that."
