GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT_BURNT = "Swell. Time to find another hobby."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT_GENERIC = "Normally I don't stick around long enough to grow a garden."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT_GROWING = "Not quite ripe."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT_NEEDSFERTILIZER = "I'll have to throw some more manure on it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN = "Hey, whatever works."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT = "All these feathers and no wings."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL = "So good it even makes my handwriting legible!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FEATHERSAIL = "I can pretend I'm flying through the water."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW = "I'll keep it to remind me of how I'm not flying."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN = "Maybe if I cover myself in feathers I can fly away from here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER = "A feather that doesn't let me fly? That hardly seems fair."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_THUNDER = "For a feather, it feels pretty heavy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FEIJOADA = "Those beans finally stopped jumping."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET = "Don't take this personal, but you're a little creepy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FENCE = "Don't fence me in."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE = "Creaky."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM = "I'd rather not carry this around any more than I have to."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM = "I bet there's a better place for this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER = "Swell. A bucket of poop."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS = "I prefer things that \"pew\" over things that \"pow\"."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES_GENERIC = "Let's be friends! I'm not just saying that 'cause I'm terrified of the dark."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES_HELD = "Now, where am I going to put you guys."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND = "Should I be terrified? Just for future reference."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT_EMBERS = "It has a certain glow about it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT_GENERIC = "I know a thing or two about hot air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT_HIGH = "That's a lot of hot air!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT_LOW = "Needs something... It needs to not go out!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT_NORMAL = "Put a balloon over that and I'm airborne again!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT_OUT = "Throw some fuel in there and it's start right up again."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIRERAIN = "Hmm... I don't remember brimstone in the weather forecast today."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIRERAINSHADOW = "Death from above."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF = "All right, I'll play with fire."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR_LOWFUEL = "I need to refuel."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR_OFF = "Well, it's not going to work when it's off."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR_ON = "Nothing keeps fire away like chucking pieces of ice at it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH = "Ah, dead fish. The most unappetising of all smells."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH3 = "It's a fish. Pretty common around here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH3_COOKED = "Swell. The fins are still attached."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH4 = "It's a fish. Apparently they live in the water."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH4_COOKED = "It looks... edible?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH5 = "It's a fish. I'll bet you a nickel I can find another one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH5_COOKED = "At least the tail is off."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD = "Amazing what you can make with a stick and some spider webs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISHINHOLE = "Nice relaxing fishing in a place surrounded by danger."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS = "Mmmm... You can hardly taste the stick."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS = "Those dead fish heads look... appetizing?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED = "Bones included at no extra cost!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM_BLUEFISH = "Fish dinners for days."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM_EMPTY = "Swell. A fish farm without any fish."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM_ONEFISH = "Could use some more swimming things. Preferably fish."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM_REDFISH = "Populating nicely."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM_STOCKED = "Nothing more exciting than waiting for fish to hatch."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM_TWOFISH = "There's something swimming around in there. Let's hope it's fish."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_MED = "I'm afraid your swimming days are over."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_MED_COOKED = "Fish steak. I'll keep the bones for dessert."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_RAW = "Swell. A fish bottom for my very own."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_RAW_SMALL = "Just a tiny bit fishy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FISH_RAW_SMALL_COOKED = "Swell. The bone is still in. "
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLAMEGEYSER = "A big crack in the ground. That's not suspicious at all."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLINT = "Looks useful. I should go hunting for more of these."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLOTSAM = "One gal's junk is another gal's sea treasure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER = "Sure I can stop and pick flowers. Not like I have anything better to do."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT = "A proper hat for adventuring in peaceful meadows."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD = "Am I supposed to eat this with a pitch fork?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE = "It's growing projectiles!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_DOUBLE = "You know what they say: Two bulbs are better than one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_TRIPLE = "That's a lot of things I can fire through the air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL = "It'd be pretty if it were a little less evil."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_RAINFOREST = "You can never have too many flowers. Or projectiles."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FLUP = "What is he so angry about? He's got an extra eyeball."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE = "Swell. A bunch of leaves."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT = "Perfect for ramming things with my head."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES = "I will call this a fruit burrito."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROG_DEAD = "I promise I will go on without you!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROG_GENERIC = "Sir, you seem to have accidentally stolen my stuff!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROG_SLEEPING = "Hopefully it's hibernating. Forever."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH = "Swamp on a bun."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS = "Nice gams!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED = "The things I do for adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON = "How adventurous am I feeling today?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON_COOKED = "Meat on a stick. Well... a bone."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON_DEAD = "Gotta be honest, I'm not going to miss you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON_GENERIC = "Are you aware of how annoying you are?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON_SLEEPING = "Probably dreaming of stealing my stuff."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY = "A cup of cold crops."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT = "What do I need more: A torpedo or a textile?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GASCLOUD = "Not a cloud I'm fond of flying through."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GASHAT = "Ah... a refinery and a fashion statement all in one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GASMASKHAT = "Stylish. I'd wear this even if it didn't save my life."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GEARS = "I should find more of these. They look useful."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET_GEMS = "Looking for gems. Aren't we all."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET_VALID = "Helps with keeping focus."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GHOST = "I'll end up one of those if I don't get out of here soon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GHOST_SAILOR = "Ahoy there, creepy!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GIANTGRUB = "My guess is he's not too interested in making friends."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER = "Do you like flying as much as I do?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER_DEAD = "Nothing but fertilizer now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER_GENERIC = "My flying buddy likes the smell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL = "I have to find a good use for it before it stinks up the place."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS = "(sigh) If only I could use them to fly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_DEAD = "I guess it can't fly me out of here now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_GENERIC = "A flyer and a glower. My new best friend."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_SLEEPING = "Wake up and glow for me!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY_COCOON = "Aww... It's wrapped up all nice and cozy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GNAT = "Normally I like being around flyers, but I'll make an exception."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GNATMOUND = "Not bad, for a mound full of bugs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK = "Nothing like a nice warm, statically-charged glass of milk."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESARMORHAT = "Great armor. Horrible goggles."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHEATHAT = "Swell. They don't work for me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESNORMALHAT = "Why would I want to make everything blurry?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESSHOOTHAT = "Oh I get what this is for! Oh wait, no I don't."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE = "Swell. Because I can't think of anything better to do with gold."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE = "For the sophisticated adventurer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE = "I used a precious metal to make a rock smasher!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK = "Because dirt needs to get dug out of the ground in style."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL = "A little gaudy for my taste."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET = "Gold! I've struck gold!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOLDPAN = "Swell. A pan with holes in it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST = "Hardly worth holding onto. If I could find more of it though..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER = "This would be useful if I could find more of them."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GRABBING_VINE = "If I didn't know any better, I'd think that vine wants my stuff."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_BARREN = "Needs some kind of fertilization."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_BURNING = "Should I bother putting it out?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_GENERIC = "I need as much of this as I can get."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_PICKED = "I hear grass grows back."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_WITHERED = "Go figure, it's having trouble growing in this excruciating heat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL_BURNING = "All those bugs have nowhere to hide now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL_GENERIC = "Tall grass like that is going to need a machete."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL_PICKED = "It'll be overgrown in no time."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA = "It's pretty. Pretty useful."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GRASS_WATER = "I wouldn't want to mow that lawn."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET = "Fabrication just got easier."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM = "Sparkly thing. Typically a good sign you're on an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF = "A stick with a stone in it. Oh, and it has magic powers."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP = "How adventurous am I feeling?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED = "Well, only one way to tell if it's poisonous or not."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM_GENERIC = "Mmmm... green mushrooms. Seems completely edible."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM_INGROUND = "Soggy feet and mushrooms. Must be rainy season."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM_PICKED = "You never really get rid of mold."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE = "How adorably appetizing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GUANO = "It's exactly what it looks like."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GUMMY_CAKE = "Mmmm... grub."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER = "Makes things go kabloo-ey."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HAIL_ICE = "Ugh! Hail! It's grounded me more times than I can count."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HALBERD = "The must-have multi-tool for adventurers."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT = "Oh good. I was looking for a way to work on my swing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HAMMER = "Everyone needs a tool to smash things with."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HANGING_VINE = "Vines. Gotta love 'em."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HARDSHELL_TACOS = "Swell. Bug cuisine."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HARPOON = "Looks like my pitching arm is going to come in handy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT = "Still smells like flowers."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE = "Take some ashes. Add some rocks. Throw in some spider guts... and voila!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK_COLD = "Pfft. I could barely get frost bite from it now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK_FROZEN = "So cold my fingers will stick to it if I'm not careful."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK_GENERIC = "It's a rock. An interesting rock. But a rock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK_HOT = "A big hot rock. What more could a gal ask for?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK_WARM = "Somewhere in between warm milk and excruciating heat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BURNING = "This town needs a fire department."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BURNT = "It's burnt down."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_GENERIC = "Not really one for city landscaping."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_SHAVEABLE = "Needs a haircut. And I need money."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BLOCK_ITEM = "Looks good. It'll look better on the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_CONE_ITEM = "Swell. That'll keep the bad guys away."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_LAYERED_ITEM = "You know there's a better option than carrying this around everywhere."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HIPPOPOTAMOOSE = "He likes making waves."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HIPPO_ANTLER = "Maybe I could use it as a hatrack. Or a hat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HOGUSPORKUSATOR = "It's just teasing me with those wings."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HOME = "The only place I've felt at home is in the sky."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN_BURNT = "Still functions as a landmark."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN_GENERIC = "It's a sign. Literally and figuratively."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN = "Doesn't say much. In fact, doesn't say anything at all."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HONEY = "That's a lot of honey, honey."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB = "More useful as a sweetener than a comb."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM = "Sticks to your ribs. And to your hands."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS = "Tiny bits of sweet meat I can launch through the air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HORN = "Meh. I like horn mine better."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI = "Smells like something burning."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HOUND = "You'd be better if you were a cat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE = "Those hounds don't leave any meat on the bone, do they?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDFIRE = "Should I be terrified? Just for future reference."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND = "Typical. Dogs never clean up after themselves."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH = "I have two words for you: Pew. Pew."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICE = "Bet these would make for some fine frigid projectiles."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX = "As long as I don't have to lug it around with me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM = "I'm going to eat this so fast I'll get an ice cream headache!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICEDTEA = "I prefer it cold anyway."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT = "Quite frankly, I don't care who sees me like this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND = "Am I supposed to be scared? Because I am."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER_HIGH = "There'll be little pellets of ice as far as the eye can see!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER_LOW = "Needs more fuel to make more frozen."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER_NORMAL = "I'm used to making ice the old fashioned way. By freezing water."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER_OUT = "Drat. I let the fuel get too low."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER_VERYLOW = "It's desperate for something to burn into ice."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK = "A nice little picnic basket."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF = "An icicle waiting to happen."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INFUSED_IRON = "Was it glowing like that before?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK_ACTIVE = "Oh I get it! It's meant to be annoying."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK_INACTIVE = "Weird little pyramids are a sure sign you're on an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_CHECK = "Swell. It's a floor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_GARDENSTONE = "All the rage with the outdoorsy types."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_GEOMETRICTILES = "Swell. It's a floor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_HERRINGBONE = "Swell. It's a floor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_HEXAGON = "Swell. It's a floor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_HOOF_CURVY = "All the rage with the piggy types."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_MARBLE = "Swell. It's a floor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_OCTAGON = "Swell. It's a floor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_PLAID_TILE = "Wish I had this for my balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_SHAG_CARPET = "Oooh. So soft."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_SHEET_METAL = "Cold on the feet."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_TRANSITIONAL = "Am I missing something or is this floor... missing something?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_WOOD = "Swell. It's a floor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_WOODPANELS = "Swell. It's a floor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_CHECKERED = "A checkered wall."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_CIRCLES = "Nice enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_FLORAL = "Nice enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_FULLWALL_MOULDING = "Nice enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_HARLEQUIN = "Makes my eyes go dizzy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_MARBLE = "Fancy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_MAYORSOFFICE = "Can help thinking this belongs in a pig office."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_PEAGAWK = "If only it would make my house fly away."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_PLAIN_DS = "It's okay."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_PLAIN_ROG = "Nothing special."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_ROPE = "Pretty good knotwork, if I do say so myself."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_SUNFLOWER = "Cheery."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_UPHOLSTERED = "Seems like the waste of a perfectly good seat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_WOOD = "That's the wall."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INVENTORYGRAVE = "That'll be me someday. But not today!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.INVENTORYMOUND = "That'll be me someday. But not today!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.IRON = "Well it's not good balloon material."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.IRONWIND = "I wish it worked on planes."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.IRON_DOOR = "It's a garden gate that leads to a room."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES = "No bread. I guess I'll just eat the whole thing straight out of the jar."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG = "Bugs or beans or something in between?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG_COOKED = "How adventurous am I feeling today?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH = "Smiley little guy. What do you know that I don't?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_COOKED = "It's like gum. Only not tasty."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_DEAD = "I'll dedicate a passage to you in my memoirs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_PLANTED = "I'd appreciate it if you didn't try to shock me while I was fighting you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JELLYJERKY = "Just as chewy as when it's not dried."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JELLYOPOP = "Looks... delicious?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE_BURNING = "Not surprising considering it's made of wood."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE_BURNT = "Well, at least I know it's not alive."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE_CHOPPED = "That was my handiwork."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE_GENERIC = "Swell. It's a tree."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED_GENERIC = "Aerodynamically suited to be fired out the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED_PLANTED = "Grow up big and not scary."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KABOBS = "Cooked to projectile perfection."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KEY_TO_CITY = "Swell. Now I can be responsible for a whole city."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE_GENERIC = "You guys should relax. You'll make more friends that way."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE_HELD = "You're going to make me honey, whether you like it or not."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER_DEAD = "I'll miss him."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER_GENERIC = "What an aerodynamic beak!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KINGFISHER_SLEEPING = "Like me, it probably dreams of flying."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT = "An accordion stomach. Bold choice. Not one I would've made."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHTBOAT = "Sure, you can float, but can you fly?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE = "Reminds me of the broken down merry-go-round I saw once."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER = "Mystery solved."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER = "Haha! Didn't think I would find you, did you?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN = "Am I supposed to be impressed? Because I am."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KRAKENCHEST = "Aw... That terrible sea monster left me a gift. How thoughtful."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN_TENTACLE = "Quit wiggling around so I can fight you!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS = "Whoops. All those little bad acts have come back to haunt me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK = "A treasure trove of extra storage!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LANTERN = "Portable light for when you're tired of lighting things on fire."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE = "Swell. They're making more."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_GENERIC = "Hatches one infant inferno."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED_COLD = "Needs something to warm up the molten lava."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY = "It's hatching. And that's... good?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET_CONTENT = "Finally, someone who appreciates my burnt meals."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET_GENERIC = "I'm going to have to baby proof the world."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET_HUNGRY = "Has this strange aversion to being hungry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET_STARVING = "Better feed it quick before it loses its cool. Or its hot."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH = "Is there a tooth fairy for these guys?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL = "Swell. I'll just dip my toe in to test the temperature."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT_COOL = "I bet it has dragonfly cooties."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT_HOT = "I'm a good spitter too, but you don't see me showing off."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND = "I'll just dip my toe in to see if it's warm enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK = "As far as lava rocks go, it's decent enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK2 = "As far as lava rocks go, it's decent enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK3 = "As far as lava rocks go, it's decent enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK4 = "As far as lava rocks go, it's decent enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK5 = "As far as lava rocks go, it's decent enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK6 = "As far as lava rocks go, it's decent enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK7 = "As far as lava rocks go, it's decent enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT_BURNING = "Finally we have proof that trees will burn."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT_BURNT = "I was never really partial to it anyway."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT_GENERIC = "Everyone needs a hobby."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LEATHER = "Strong. Pliable. Good for clothing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LEIF = "I'm sure I'll look back on this one day and laugh."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE = "I don't mean to alarm you, but you appear to be a walking tree."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LICHEN = "Looks projectile-y."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIF_PLANT = "You stay right there until I need you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB = "Glowing projectiles. Perfect."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER = "This is dangerous in the wrong hands."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT_CHARGED = "My hair gets like that in a thunderstorm too."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT_GENERIC = "Seems friendly enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN = "I guess I could poke something with it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD_CHARGED = "Keeps the darkness and the lightning away. My new favorite thing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD_GENERIC = "Does disguising itself like lightning help it do its job?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LILYPAD = "A little too heavy to use for a balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONE = "I sacrificed color in favor of usefulness."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIMPETROCK_GENERIC = "There are sea creatures stuck to that rock. And they're edible!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIMPETROCK_PICKED = "It's no longer infected with sea creatures."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS = "Mmm... food from a rock. Fine dining."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED = "I've heard the best food comes from a rock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS = "Not everyone can pull off a mustache like that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIVINGJUNGLETREE = "Is it me, or is that strange behavior for a tree?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG = "Don't look at me like that. I didn't put you in that log."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE = "You know, where I come from trees don't normally move so much."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LIVING_ARTIFACT = "An invitation to adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER = "Don't mind me, just trying to capture you for my dinner."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE = "You better stay closed, claws."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER = "A nice buttery crustacean."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERHOLE = "There's something hiding down there. Something delicious."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD = "Your adventure has ended but my dinner has just begun!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD_COOKED = "A lot of meat on its not bones."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOCKEDWES = "Just say the word and I'll get you out of there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOG_BURNING = "Doing what it was made to do."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOG_GENERIC = "Could use some more of these."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOGRAFT = "About as stable as a wooden balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOTUS = "Almost worth getting my feet wet for that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER = "Looks edible."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LOTUS_FLOWER_COOKED = "Not the first time I've eaten flowers."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LUCY = "You look different. Different is good."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST = "I'm sure whoever that belongs to is long dead."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LUR_PLANT = "Animal or vegetable? Make up your mind!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB = "A plantable pet. Swell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MACHETE = "Machete. Designed for adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAGIC_SEAL = "That's a treasure if I ever saw one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK = "One thing adventuring has taught me: always check under the rocks."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_FULL = "One thing adventuring has taught me: always check under the rocks."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD = "There's gold in them there rocks!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD_FULL = "There's gold in them there rocks!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS = "For finding the tiny hidden treasures. And burning stuff."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET = "Looks like he's having a bad day."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_DEAD = "Forgive me if I don't mourn your death."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_GENERIC = "Swell. I picked up an annoying sidekick."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PICKED = "Give me one good reason why I shouldn't just launch you out of the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEHOUSE = "Have you ever seen anything scream \"adventure\" louder?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEMAN = "Mind not eating me, I have adventuring to do."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP = "Perfect soup for a sleepy afternoon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED = "Just looking at it makes me yawn."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE = "I'm guessing it's safe from fire in this water."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE_BURNT = "Guess it wasn't safe from fire in this water."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL = "A puffy projectile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARBLE = "Now I can build the Parthenon I always wanted."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR = "A perfectly good marble column just sitting there for anyone to take."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE = "Did it just grow like that?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH_BURNING = "Serves you right."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH_GENERIC = "I'm beginning to think it's trying to keep people away."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH_PICKED = "Don't worry, it'll be dry and thorny in no time."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT = "I'm looking for something more adventurous than a plant."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT_TROPICAL = "Oh look! It's a plant!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE_BURNING = "As long as it's not me on fire."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE_BURNT = "A nice shade of burnt."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE_CHOPPED = "I put it to good use."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE_GENERIC = "Twigs and wood. Mostly twigs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL = "Don't take this the wrong way, but you're evil."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD = "I could make my head that big too, I just choose to value onto my morality."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT = "Whoever put this here is my new best friend."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK = "Seems like the kind of thing I would want to unlock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH = "Is there some kind of dance party going on?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE = "That would be a great adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP_DEAD = "It died so young. So young and so horrible."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP_GENERIC = "I like you guys better when you're old and can't move around so much."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MEAN_FLYTRAP_SLEEPING = "All tuckered out after a day of terrorizing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MEAT = "Meat. It tastes like meat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS = "Perfectly rounded edible projectiles."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_BURNT = "A little too dry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_DONE = "Dry, chewy and ready for adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_DRYING = "It's like watching food dry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_DRYINGINRAIN = "This rain's not helping things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_GENERIC = "Dried food is all I ever eat on long balloon trips."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED = "Small, dry and ready to be eaten."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MERM = "Hi, I'm Wheeler. And you are... not human?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MERMFISHER = "Born to fish."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD_BURNT = "Well, I won't miss it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD_GENERIC = "Yeesh. Heck of a welcoming party."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_BURNT = "I'm sure they'll rebuild."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_GENERIC = "Nice house. Could do with some air freshener though."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_FISHER = "What a... colorful smell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE = "Adventure just seems to find me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY = "Swell. An empty bottle. Just what I was looking for."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.METALPLATEHAT = "Saves me head pain but gives me neck pain."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT = "Does it glow brighter if I think harder?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_GENERIC = "A sign. Always useful for organizing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_UNDRAWN = "Swell. A sign announcing nothing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM = "I should put this somewhere, I'm getting tired of lugging it around."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR = "I'm guessing he's guarding something. Big monsters usually are."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST = "Experience tells me these things aren't always what they seem."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN = "Seems a shame to waste it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOLE_ABOVEGROUND = "Hoo hoo! I'll get you yet!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOLE_HELD = "So you're the one eating all my ammo!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOLE_UNDERGROUND = "Get outta there!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT = "Ready for a little nighttime exploring?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL = "Where are you hiding?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MONKEY = "I can launch things too, you know."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBALL = "I'm pretty proud of the sewing job on this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL = "It's trying to look scary, but it doesn't quite pull it off."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA = "I've had some bad meals in my lifetime. And this is one of them."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT = "What's that smell? It smells like... horror?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED = "Drying it really seals in the horror."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE = "I'd just as soon launch this out of the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET = "One day I'll walk on the moon, but this will do for now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOOSE = "Tell me, can you fly with those wings?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG = "A tempest in an egg cup."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND = "Looks cozy. Kinda."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_GENERIC = "You don't deserve to fly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_HELD = "Haha! Not so annoying now, are you!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK = "I'm taking my blood back."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK_YELLOW = "Whose blood is in this?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_POISON = "You don't deserve those wings."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING = "You could be a great flyer if you just applied yourself."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOUND_DUG = "It's not like they were using it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MOUND_GENERIC = "I'm just one bad adventure away from being a mound of dirt."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE = "Frees up some pocket space."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM = "I've seen that kind of thing in cellars."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL = "A Christmas tree for spelunkers."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL = "A bit of a mold problem in here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED = "Mold and a lot of spiders. Reminds me of my Grandma's cellar."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL = "Eating raw seafood would be an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MUSSELBOUILLABAISE = "They grew those shells just so they could be used as spoons."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_BED = "Not much use out of the water."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_COOKED = "Tiny little snacks from the sea."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM_GENERIC = "What are they doing way down there?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM_STICKPLANTED = "\"Maybelle Wheeler and the Secret of the Mussel Bed\"."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_STICK = "Huh. I don't know what those sea creatures see in this stick."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MYSTERYMEAT = "How adventurous am I feeling?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NECTAR_POD = "Now to find something that'll make this into something good."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NEEDLESPEAR = "This is nice but I need more to make anything decent with it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_DEFAULT = "Smells like it's up to something."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_EMPTY = "Hurry up and grow! I need those leaves!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_MOIST = "Oh. It likes the water."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLE_WITHERED = "Not having fun here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NETTLELOSANGE = "The cure is only slightly better than the ailment."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT = "It's like a garden light fueled by evil."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL = "A perfectly normal fuel source made of dark souls."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT = "Light is good. Light is very good."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_CALM = "A little too calm around here for my taste."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_DAWN = "Well, that was fun."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_NOMAGIC = "Nothing going on here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_STEADY = "I wanted an adventure. This is definitely an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_WANING = "Things are getting back to normal. Whatever \"normal\" is."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_WARN = "Something's happening. I don't know what, but definitely something."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE_WAXING = "Things are getting... interesting."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK = "Speak softly and carry a bright stick."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD = "Well if this doesn't say adventure, I don't know what does."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NITRE = "It's not gold, but it's not useless."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.NUBBIN = "Look small enough to fire out a Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN = "I like this rock. It's feisty."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANAXE = "Well, that's certainly enlightening."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE = "I bet it goes kabloo-ey."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_EMBERS = "It has a glow about it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_GENERIC = "I know a thing or two about hot air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_HIGH = "That's a lot of hot air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_LOW = "Needs something..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_NORMAL = "Put a balloon over that and I'm airborne again."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT_OUT = "Throw some logs in there and it'll start right up again."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANMACHETE = "It's a machete and a hand warmer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANSPEARGUN = "A flaming projectile. One thing the Pew-matic doesn't have."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN_WORKBENCH = "Look, someone threw out a perfectly good workbench."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSCHEST = "I have to admit, that's a cool magic trick."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSKING = "One day I hope to retire to a rock of my own."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OINC = "Good for buying projectiles. Or being projectiles."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OINC10 = "Moving up in the world."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OINC100 = "You know what Wheeler, you deserve a treat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND = "I wonder if I can play \"Twinkle Twinkle\" on this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET = "It must sense my magnetic personality."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM = "Orange you glad it wasn't a banana?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF = "Not as good as flying, but it'll have to do."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ORGANIC_DOOR = "That's not creepy at all."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OX = "You'd think the water would wash away all its stink."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OXHAT = "All the rage with the 'not dying' crowd."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE = "If I play it out the other end does it make it not rain?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN = "Someone else's teeth."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PACKIM = "A flyer who appreciates the need for storage space. We have so much in common."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PACKIM_FISHBONE = "Swell. A dead fish. Just what I need."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF = "So many uses. Projectile being the best one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_HUT = "Seems... safe?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_UMBRELLA = "A portable tree to stand under."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_BURNING = "Proof positive that wood does burn."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_BURNT = "That's not going to grow back."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_CHOPPED = "I believe that was my handywork."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_GENERIC = "These trees look different from the air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_BURNT = "It doesn't help that those leaves fanned the flames."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE_STUMP = "That may have been my fault."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST = "It's a trap! But it's also very, very tempting."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE = "Pan flute music: so boring everyone falls instantly asleep."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PANGOLDEN = "I don't actually mind picking up his poop."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS = "Dear Diary, today I made paper."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PARROT = "Could you get some of your friends together to fly me away from here?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE_DEAD = "Rests in peace."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE_GENERIC = "Beautiful wings. Can I use 'em?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE_SLEEPING = "Sweet dreams."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PARROT_PIRATE = "A flyer and an adventurer. We've got a lot in common!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEACOCK = "Pretty. Pretty conceded."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_DEAD = "I promise, I will go on without you!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_GENERIC = "Has the eyesight for flying but not the wings for it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_SLEEPING = "Maybe I can just pluck out one of those feathers..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWKFEATHER = "Normally I don't mind feathers, but this one keeps staring at me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWKFEATHERHAT = "If only it let me fly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWKFEATHER_PRISM = "If only it let me fly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEAGAWK_BUSH = "Something's hiding in there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEDESTAL_KEY = "Locks and keys. The cornerstone of every good adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN_DEAD = "I promise, I will go on without you!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN_GENERIC = "She's very sensibly dressed."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN_SLEEPING = "That little gal's no threat to me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEG_LEG = "Well, it's not mine."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN = "You're going to get your suit dirty sliding around in it like that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PERD = "Not the smartest bird in the bush."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES = "Food. For me or the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PETALS = "Perfectly good ammo, just laying around."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL = "I found all this perfectly good ammo just laying on the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PHEROMONESTONE = "Now I can make small talk with the big bugs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM = "Just what I need. A hunk of goop."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE = "Swell. Now I have no excuse not to do back-breaking mining work."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGBANDIT = "Don't like your attitude, but I admire your sense of style."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGCROWNHAT = "Something about this tells me it belongs to royalty."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGEON_DEAD = "Always sad to see a fellow flyer go down."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGEON_GENERIC = "Fly! Fly away from here! And take me with you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGEON_SLEEPING = "Probably having one of those flying dreams."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGGHOST = "Why do ancient ruins always have to be haunted?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PI_GUARD = "Not everyone can pull off a look like that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK = "Storage space! Just what I always wanted!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD_BURNT = "Can't say I'm going to miss it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD_GENERIC = "He's not going anywhere."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_BURNT = "Guess there's no fire department around here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FULL = "Looks like a party going on. And I'm not invited."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_GENERIC = "Should I knock and ask to borrow some bacon grease?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_LIGHTSOUT = "They need all the beauty sleep they can get."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY_BURNING = "Someone's having a bad day."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_CITY_GENERIC = "As pig houses go, it's decent enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM_BURNING = "They're not sleeping there tonight."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_FARM_GENERIC = "I thought they would've built their home out of straw."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE_BURNING = "Huh. Wouldn't think stone would burn that well."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE_MINE_GENERIC = "Looks like they put all those rocks into building a house."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGKING = "One thing about traveling the world, you learn to barter with everyone."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_DEAD = "Lived a better life than the other pigs I've known."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FOLLOWER = "Swell. A pig sidekick."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_GENERIC = "I hope he doesn't ask me my views on bacon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_GUARD = "Not everyone can pull off a look like that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_WEREPIG = "Don't take this the wrong way, but you may need a shave."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER_GENERIC = "He likes the shiny things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BANKER_SLEEPING = "Someone's liable to rob him like this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN_GENERIC = "A lady who likes her feathers."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_BEAUTICIAN_SLEEPING = "No pillow. Maybe that's what she needs all those feathers for."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_COLLECTOR_GENERIC = "Someone who appreciates the junk I find on my adventures."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_COLLECTOR_SLEEPING = "Should I poke him to see if he's still alive?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE_GENERIC = "A purveyor of fine esoteric interests."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ERUDITE_SLEEPING = "All that nightmare fuel must give her nightmares."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FARMER_GENERIC = "A simple pig with simple desires. Namely, that I don't steal his stuff."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FARMER_SLEEPING = "No doubt dreaming of a bedroom."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST_GENERIC = "Personally, my interests go beyond flower petals, but to each their own."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST_SLEEPING = "Couldn't even make it to her home."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER_GENERIC = "What's she so happy about? I probably don't want to know."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HATMAKER_SLEEPING = "Sweet dreams."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HUNTER_GENERIC = "Looks like someone who's been in a lot of fights."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_HUNTER_SLEEPING = "Maybe he just likes to sleep under the stars."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_MAYOR_GENERIC = "In all my adventures, I've never been able to escape bureaucracy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_MAYOR_SLEEPING = "You'd think a fancy pig like him would have a home to go to."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_MECHANIC_GENERIC = "Swell. He can fix a house but not a balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_MECHANIC_SLEEPING = "I guess his home is still a work in progress."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_MINER_GENERIC = "You like rocks? Just plain old everyday rocks? Okay..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_MINER_SLEEPING = "So tired he didn't even make it back to his home."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_PROFESSOR_GENERIC = "Ah! Someone who appreciates all my archeological finds."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_PROFESSOR_SLEEPING = "Probably dreaming of adventures."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ROYALGUARD_GENERIC = "Not looking to cause any trouble here, officer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ROYALGUARD_SLEEPING = "Doesn't seem like he gets the concept of guarding."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ROYALGUARD_2_GENERIC = "Looks like he'd be a good adventuring companion."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_ROYALGUARD_2_SLEEPING = "Doesn't inspire a lot of confidence."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_STOREOWNER_GENERIC = "Someone who appreciates her town's landscaping."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_STOREOWNER_SLEEPING = "I'm going to go out on a limb and say she's tired."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_USHER_GENERIC = "You look like you've seen your share of adventures."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_USHER_SLEEPING = "Aw... so cute."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN = "I have so many uses for pig butt."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT = "I've slept in worse."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH = "Those pigs do have nice garden lamps."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN = "I'm not in this for monetary gain. But I'll keep this anyway."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_GUARD_TOWER_BURNING = "Was that an accident or a comment on the local authorities."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_GUARD_TOWER_GENERIC = "The local police station."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_GUARD_TOWER_PALACE_BURNING = "A sign of things to come?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_GUARD_TOWER_PALACE_GENERIC = "As impenetrable as the royal guard."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_LATIN_1 = "\"Ightlay iresfay\". Pig latin? Really?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_PALACE = "Ohh! A castle adventure. I love those."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_QUEEN = "Dorothea Maybelle Wheeler at your service, your majesty."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ARTICHOKE = "Strange thing to make a statue out of."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_CREEPING_VINES = "This place needs a gardener."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_DART_STATUE = "I'm going to go ahead and assume that's a trap."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_DART_TRAP = "That's a trap if I've ever seen it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE_GENERIC = "Adventure awaits!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE_LOCKED = "There's always a way in. I just have to figure it out."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE2 = "Off to adventure!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE3 = "Exactly the kind of place I was looking for."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE4 = "I bet there's all kinds of adventure down there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE5 = "Only one way to know what's in there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_ENTRANCE_SMALL = "Well, well, well. What do we have here?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_EXIT = "To the real would. Or what passes for real around here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_EXIT2 = "Looks to me like that's a way out."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_EXIT4 = "Looks interesting..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_HEAD = "Missing something... like its body."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_IDOL = "I'll need to get that totem free to take it back to the pigs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_PIG = "Oooh! Look at those golden teeth!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_PLAQUE = "The pigs only want the top part. How do I get it free?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_PRESSURE_PLATE = "I know a pressure plate when I see one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_SPEAR_TRAP = "Has the distinct look of a boobytrap."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_SPEAR_TRAP_BROKEN = "You've lost your ambushing privileges."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_SPEAR_TRAP_TRIGGERED = "Haha! I'm still standing, trap!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_TORCH = "Complementary torches! They really know how to treat a gal right!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_TORCH_WALL = "Complementary torches! They really know how to treat a gal right!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SCEPTER = "Looks good enough to bonk someone on the head with."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_ACADEMY_BURNING = "All that history. Up in flames."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_ACADEMY_GENERIC = "It's full of pig history."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_ANTIQUITIES_BURNING = "I'll wait until after it's done burning to go inside."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_ANTIQUITIES_GENERIC = "I could pick up a few odds and ends."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_ARCANE_BURNING = "Well if you're going to leave fire staffs just laying around..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_ARCANE_GENERIC = "A magic shop with actual magic in it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_BANK_BURNING = "Can't go in there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_BANK_GENERIC = "Nothing more adventurous than exchanging money."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_CITYHALL_BURNING = "That'll cost some tax dollars to fix."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_CITYHALL_GENERIC = "The big pig building in this small pond."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_CITYHALL_PLAYER_BURNING = "My schedule just got wide open."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_CITYHALL_PLAYER_GENERIC = "Mayor by day, adventurer by night."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_DELI_BURNING = "Now where am I going to eat?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_DELI_GENERIC = "Is there a dress code for this fine eating establishment?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_FLORIST_BURNING = "Stick a balloon on that and it'll float away."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_FLORIST_GENERIC = "I prefer my seeds launched out the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_GENERAL_BURNING = "Maybe they'll have a fire sale."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_GENERAL_GENERIC = "What kind of a general store doesn't sell hot air balloons?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_HATSHOP_BURNING = "A bad day for hats."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_HATSHOP_GENERIC = "A good hat is always handy for bad hair days."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_HOOFSPA_BURNING = "Swell. I hope they have insurance."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_HOOFSPA_GENERIC = "Sells incidental things like life-saving medicines."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_PRODUCE_BURNING = "Normally cook-outs are thrown outside buildings."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_PRODUCE_GENERIC = "Food!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_TINKER_BURNING = "I hope they kept the building blueprints so they can rebuild."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_TINKER_GENERIC = "I suppose balloon blueprints would be too much too ask."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_WEAPONS_BURNING = "It wasn't me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_WEAPONS_GENERIC = "Nothing as good as the Pew-matic in there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIKE_SKULL = "I'm going to try and avoid that same fate."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIKO_DEAD = "Sad. It only wanted to steal things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIKO_GENERIC = "Has more storage space in its cheeks than I do in my pockets."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIKO_SLEEPING = "At least it doesn't steal in its sleep."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIKO_ORANGE = "Has a strangely caffeinated smell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PILLAR_DOOR = "A really fancy door to another room of my stuff."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_GENERIC = "It's almost a crime not to launch this through the air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_PLANTED = "Grow up big and strong. So I can cut you down."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIRATEGHOST = "Swell. Just swell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIRATEHAT = "This adventure just got pirated."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIRATEPACK = "Storage space that pays for itself!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR_BURNT = "It probably deserved it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR_GENERIC = "It pillages the magical knowledge."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK = "For eating big meals."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PITHHAT = "A proper adventuring hat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT = "Green. Grown on a plant. Everything you want in a piece of meat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED = "I'll try to eat around the green parts."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL_GENERIC = "I believe the name for that is \"plant\"."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL_GROWING = "It's growing! I guess I'm not a totally incompetant gardener."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY = "Harvest time!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL_WITHERED = "If you can't take the heat, get out of the garden."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLATE_DOOR = "Well, I guess it's not going to fall down, anyway."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY_BURNT = "I guess I'm sleeping rough tonight."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY_FORSALE = "It's a fixer upper but it's close to all the shops."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY_SOLD = "I'm excited about the extra storage space!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_BRICK = "My home."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_BRICK_CRAFT = "You know this is all for show."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_COTTAGE = "If I can't fly away, I might as well make myself comfortable."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_COTTAGE_CRAFT = "Some fancy coverings for my home."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_GOTHIC = "My current place of residence."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_GOTHIC_CRAFT = "For spookying my house up."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_MANOR = "Look at me now!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_MANOR_CRAFT = "If only I could tie a balloon to this and float away."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TUDOR = "My fancy home."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TUDOR_CRAFT = "Well, better get building."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET = "Never thought I'd live in something like this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET_CRAFT = "You could pop a balloon on that turret spike!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA = "Home. At least until I get out of here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA_CRAFT = "A bundle of things to make my home nice and pretty."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POG_APORKALYPSE = "Are you aware that you're terrifying now?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POG_FOLLOWER = "Swell. Another mouth to feed."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POG_GENERIC = "You're cute. You'd be cuter as a cat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POG_SLEEPING = "Finally, it stopped eating."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POISONCROCODOG = "Pardon me while avoid your teeth."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POISONHOLE = "Smells like a trap. Also smells like a sewer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE = "A bunch of seeds in the guise of a fruit."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED = "You can cook anything. Whether it's good or not is another story."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS = "Seeds. To plant or launch through the air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POND = "Something fishy about that pond. Might be the fish."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE = "Looks like some kind of... plant?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POOP = "Never thought I'd say this, but I could really use that poop."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_ENTRANCE = "I've my doubts it'll actually fly, but I'm desperate."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_EXIT = "Does it actually fly?!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO = "Are you deliberately avoiding me?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BALLOON = "There go all my dreams."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_BASKET = "Grounded."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_FLAGS = "Doing a great job decorating the ground right now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SANDBAG = "Ballast. Or a ballistic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SUITCASE = "Nothing but mold in there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_TRUNK = "It might be good for parts."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PORTAL_SHIPWRECKED = "That's an adventure waiting to happen. It's also waiting to work."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN = "Aww... A house warming gift. How nice!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE = "Looks good enough to fire through the air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPE = "There are better things to throw than poop."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPEBARREL = "Where'd they take all my things?!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PROP_DOOR = "Hmmm... that deserves a closer look."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK = "Time to use those dodging skills, Wheeler."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_CORPSE = "It conveniently dug its own grave."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_FOUNTAIN = "The legendary Fountain of Youth! I've found it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_RUINS_PILLAR = "Looks sturdy enough."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_SKULL = "It's dead. Why do I feel like it's still staring at me?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PUGALISK_TRAP_DOOR = "That looks... ominous."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN = "And it's not even fall! Or is it?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE = "I prefer chocolate chips to chunks of pumpkin."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED = "Gives off the smell of fresh jack-o-lantern."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN = "Who knew bugs and a rotting vegetable could be so comforting."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS = "Pew! Pew!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET = "The kind of thing that'll give you nightmares."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM = "Shiny. Purple. Ready for evil."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.QUACKENBEAK = "Something to remember my adventures. This and my scars."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.QUACKENDRILL = "Too bad tar tycoons aren't as rich as oil tycoons."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.QUACKERINGRAM = "When in doubt, ram 'em."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RABBIT_GENERIC = "Fur balls of food."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RABBIT_HELD = "This will probably not end well for you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE_GENERIC = "Maybe they're part of an underground resistance."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING = "Hope they're relaxing in little mud baths down there."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE_BURNT = "Looks a little burnt."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE_GENERIC = "Both room and board. Clever."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE_DEAD = "Not too sorry about that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE_GENERIC = "Probably just agitated because it can't fly well."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RABID_BEETLE_SLEEPING = "Quite the snorer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RADISH = "Little Pew-matic pellets that came from the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_COOKED = "Spicy! I like it!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_PLANTED = "Those look like radishes!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RADISH_SEEDS = "Ammo! Or food, whichever."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAFT = "Would probably work just as well as an aeroplane."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH = "I found the end of the rainbow jellyfish."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_COOKED = "What it lost in shine, it gained in palatability."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_DEAD = "Shiny happy food."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_PLANTED = "Why are you so happy?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYJERKY = "Just as chewy as it was before."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT = "Alright rain, hit me with your best shot!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE_BURNING = "Where's the fire department when you need them?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE_BURNT = "Still good for charcoal."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE_CHOPPED = "I believe that was my doing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE_GENERIC = "Those are pretty leaves."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINFORESTTREE_ROT = "Not exactly the picture of health."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT = "Keeps my noggin nice and dry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER_BURNT = "Guess it can't predict fire as well as it predicts rain."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER_GENERIC = "A good aeronaut always has a barometer handy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE = "I don't think there are any rats in it, but you never know around here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAWLING = "You look like you've seen your share of adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAZOR = "I've never seen a serrated razor before."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.RUBBLE = "Needs work. Needs a lot of work."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RECONSTRUCTION_PROJECT.SCAFFOLD = "I hope they're not done."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.REDBARREL = "A Ka-BLAMMER. Or is it a Ka-BLOOEYER?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.REDGEM = "It's still warm from its last use."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN = "Must be some kind of celebration going on here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP = "Nothing safer than eating a strange mushroom off the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED = "Cooking toxic mushrooms make them...safer?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM_GENERIC = "I'm expecting a little gnome to come out any minute now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM_INGROUND = "It's hiding. I don't blame it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM_PICKED = "I really don't care if it grows back or not."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.REEDS_BURNING = "Well at least they're by the water."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.REEDS_GENERIC = "This is good. More would be better."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.REEDS_PICKED = "Grow! Grow! Grow! Grow!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.REEDS_WATER = "Definitely going to need more of these."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST = "My sneaking around skills will finally get noticed."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RELIC_BROKEN = "A little love will fix that up. A little love and some rocks."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RELIC_GENERIC = "Someone moved out in a hurry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RELIC_1_GENERIC = "Looks like something the pig history buffs would like."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RELIC_1_SUNKEN = "I'll need something to fish it out with."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2_GENERIC = "Pig history. Someone's bound to love this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RELIC_2_SUNKEN = "I'm hoping that's not a really big fish."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RELIC_3_GENERIC = "This belongs in a museum."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RELIC_3_SUNKEN = "How am I going to get it out of there?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RELIC_4 = "Looks fancy. And royal. And it looks like a pig."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RELIC_5 = "Well it's valuable to someone."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB_BURNT = "I'm guessing it's time to rebuild."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB_GENERIC = "Time to make some discoveries of the scientific variety!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2_BURNT = "Swell. It's useless now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2_GENERIC = "Alright machine, tell me something I don't know."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3_BURNT = "A sure sign it wasn't fireproofed."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3_GENERIC = "Oooh. Dark and mysterious. I like it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4_BURNT = "Couldn't pull a fire extinguisher out of that top hat?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4_GENERIC = "Well la di da! Aren't you fancy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB5 = "Am I sure that bamboo will keep it out of the water?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE_BURNT = "Not so great at resurrecting itself."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE_GENERIC = "Adventuring insurance."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE = "The perfect precious stone for any adventurer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_GENERIC = "Mind lending me your wings so I can fly away from here?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_HELD = "I know how it feels to not be able to fly away."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER_GENERIC = "How do you fly in this weather?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER_HELD = "Fly me away."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET = "You look like you've had a bad day."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK = "That's a projectile just waiting to happen."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCKS = "A bunch of projectiles. Just sitting there on the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCKY = "You look like you've had some adventures."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ANTCAVE = "It's a rock. I've seen others."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_BASALT = "A rock. You see a lot of them around here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CHARCOAL = "I'm going to need more of these."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_FLIPPABLE = "My grandma taught me to always look under rocks."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_GENERIC = "Breaks up into a bunch of frozen projectiles."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED = "It's all wet."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED = "Kinda puts a damper on things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT_GENERIC = "A crusted over pit of lava: a sure sign you're on an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT_LOW = "Does lava burn out?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT_NORMAL = "If only there was a way to harness this into a balloon burner."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT_OUT = "Well, I knew it couldn't last."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROCK_OBSIDIAN = "It'd be useful to have a lot more of these."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_HEAD = "Yes! Fly me away from here!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_LEG = "Maybe if I can hang onto its legs, I can fly again."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH1 = "Maybe I can get some wood out of it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BRANCH2 = "Probably good for some wood."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_BUSH = "Swell. Another bush. How unusual."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS1 = "Someone left their junk lying around."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS2 = "That bird isn't exactly keen on cleaning up."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS3 = "Not the kind of treasure I was expecting."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_DEBRIS4 = "It might be worth breaking it apart."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_EGG1 = "Parts of an egg."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_EGG2 = "Please let it belong to a bird and not a reptile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_EGG3 = "Someone making scrambled eggs?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_EGG4 = "It's an egg shell. I don't suppose there's a bird around."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_HOUSE = "Well, they probably have a nice view."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_RUSTY_LAMP = "Maybe it's good for parts?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_TREE1 = "It's just an old tree."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_TREE2 = "It's just an old tree."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_NEST_TRUNK = "Hope that bird doesn't break me in half like that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_ROBIN_EGG = "Maybe if I help it hatch, it'll fly me away from here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROC_TAIL = "Those feathers look big enough to lift me off the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROE = "Baby fish. Just waiting to hatch."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROE_COOKED = "Look how nicely they lined up."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROOK = "Swell. And I was having such a good day."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE = "Stuck together with gears and sticky tape."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROOTTRUNK_CHILD = "All my storage problems, solved!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROPE = "I feel really confident about the strength of this braided grass."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG = "Smells like sulphur. And sulphur goes boom."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROUND_DOOR = "Is it... going to eat me?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROWBOAT = "If only I had oars for my balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_GALLERY = "A tribute to someone else's adventures."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN = "Not a flyer, but it has a lot of cargo space."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RO_BIN_GIZZARD_STONE = "Not sure what's worse: the slime, or the weird eye."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE = "A little love will fix that up. A little love and some rocks."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_BEARD = "Don't ask where the hair came from."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_BRAID = "I braided it myself."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_CATCOON = "It was dead when I found it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_CRIME = "I'm not going to ask."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_FUR = "Keeps my toes cozy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_HEDGEHOG = "A pretty little rug."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_HOOFPRINT = "A pretty little rug."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_METAL = "Bare bones. Actually bare metal."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_NAILBED = "Swell. Just swell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_OCTAGON = "Brightens up the place."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_OVAL = "Pretty little rug."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_PORCUPUSS = "I took all the quills out. I think."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_RECTANGLE = "A pretty little rug."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_ROUND = "Swell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_RUBBERMAT = "Nice and soft."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_SQUARE = "Keeps my toes warm."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_SWIRL = "Making me dizzy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_TILES = "A pretty little rug."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_WEB = "Not as sticky as you might think."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUG_WORMHOLE = "A rug tribute to a fallen wormhole."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT = "A crown you can wear anywhere. Even fighting monsters."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT = "All those years playing stick ball will finally come in handy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE = "A little love will fix that up. A little love and some rocks."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN = "A shoehorn for a saddle."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC = "I like it. But I'm not the one who has to wear it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE = "Woowee! You can really get some speed on this!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR = "Extra durable for the extra adventurous."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SAIL = "Leaves. What can't they do?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SAIL_STICK = "Why couldn't I have found this when I had my balloon?!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK = "Swell. It's a big lump of salt."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SAND = "I can fire it out my Pew-matic and it doesn't even gum up the works."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SANDBAG = "I used them for balloon ballast, but I'm sure they're good for other things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL = "I used to use them as ballast."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL_ITEM = "Even small sandbags are heavy to carry around all the time."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SANDBAG_ITEM = "One thing I know about heavy sandbags, they're better when you're not carrying them."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SANDHILL = "A pile of uniform grains of sand. Exactly what I'm looking for in an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SAND_CASTLE_GENERIC = "Why have real adventures when I can play adventures in the sand?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SAND_CASTLE_SAND = "Why have real adventures when I can play adventures in the sand?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK_ACTIVE = "It's hiding from my voracious wit."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK_INACTIVE = "Where has it been hiding?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING_BURNING = "Nothing left to do but watch it burn."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING_GENERIC = "Kind of twiggy. I can work with twigs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING_PICKED = "It's been de-twigged."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SAPLING_WITHERED = "Likes this heat about as much as I do."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON = "You really have to watch your skeletons around a fire."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SCORPION_DEAD = "I'll be honest, I don't care."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SCORPION_GENERIC = "Keep your stinger to yourself, mister!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SCORPION_SLEEPING = "I'll just sneak by..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO = "Swell. Fish bones soup."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL = "I wouldn't mind if you flew me out of here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL_WATER = "You have wings, why aren't you flying!?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEASACK = "Refrigerated pocket space!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL = "Pretty useless by themselves but an armful of them would come in incredibly handy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL_BEACHED = "Someone left a perfectly good seashell just laying on the beach!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEATRAP = "It looks that way so the crustaceans won't recognize that I'm desperate."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED = "Wet, soppy projectile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_COOKED = "A nice big pile of... food?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_DRIED = "Maybe I could make a paper airplane out of it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED = "Well, that's one way to ensure you get enough water."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_STALK = "This needs to get planted."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA_EMBERS = "Still glowing, but nearing its demise."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA_GENERIC = "I know a thing or two about hot air."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA_HIGH = "That's a lot of hot air!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA_LOW = "Needs something... probably something to burn."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA_NORMAL = "Put a balloon over that and I'm airborne again!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA_OUT = "Swell. It's gone out."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD_LOWFUEL = "Needs tar. Lots of tar."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD_OFF = "The repairer has become the repairee."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD_ON = "If I had this for my balloon, I wouldn't be stranded here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SECURITYCONTRACT = "My own traveling party."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEDIMENTPUDDLE = "A sparkly pool. A little too sparkly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEEDS = "Seedy little guys."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED = "Not too late to be used as a projectile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT = "Is it too much to ask to have a personal tailor sew everything for me?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHADOWSKITTISH_WATER = "Well, I wanted an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHARKFINSOUP = "I'll eat it as long as it doesn't start swimming again."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTEN = "Don't pet the kitten, Wheeler. Don't. Pet. The. Kitten."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER_GENERIC = "It holds kittens. Dangerous kittens."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER_INACTIVE = "I regret not petting the kittens when I had the chance."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHARK_FIN = "It deserves to swim again. In a soup."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHARK_GILLS = "It's important to use the whole animal."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHARK_TEETHHAT = "The gold tooth is a nice touch."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHARX = "I'd like you a lot more if you were a sea cat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHEARS = "Time to do some yard work."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_ADJUSTABLE = "Desperately needed storage space."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_AFRAME = "Storage space!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_BASIC = "Keeps my things off the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_CINDERBLOCKS = "Keeps my things off the floor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_CRATES = "Nothing fancy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_FLOATING = "Keeps my things off the ground. And off-kilter."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_FRIDGE = "What it lacks in freezing power it gains in storage space."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_GLASS = "Fragile but useful."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_HATTREE = "Storage space."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_HOOKS = "Keeps my things off the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_HUTCH = "Storage space!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_INDUSTRIAL = "More storage space!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_LADDER = "Keeps my things off the floor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_MARBLE = "Desperately needed storage space."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_METAL = "Sturdy storage."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_MIDCENTURY = "Storage space."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_PALLET = "Nothing fancy, but it works."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_PIPE = "Desperately needed storage space."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_WALLMOUNT = "Keeps my things off the floor."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_WOOD = "Storage space!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_ENTRANCE = "Off to another adventure!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_EXIT = "Off to another adventure!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL = "Good for digging things. And whacking things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT_BURNT = "It looks burnt out."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT_GENERIC = "For little day trips to dreamland."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SILK = "Made by the finest enormous spiders."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON = "Always a good sign there's adventure ahead."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER = "Wow. That's a new one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST = "Exactly what I was looking for!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLOTMACHINE = "Come on... Wheeler needs a new balloon..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLUGBUG = "Swell. A slimy thing I found under a rock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLUGBUG_COOKED = "How adventurous am I feeling today?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLURPER = "I'll make you a deal: you keep your slobber, I'll keep my brain."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT = "Light and fluffy. I need to find more of these."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT = "It'd be better if there were more of these."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE = "A little advice: You might go faster if you ditched that heavy shell."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT = "I like it. It shows off my desire not to get hurt."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE = "Not my idea of a dream home."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME = "Looks a lot like a slimy projectile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES = "Pfft. Not even good as ammunition."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD_GENERIC = "Look at you flying. What's your secret?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD_HUNGRY = "Better feed this guy before he realizes he can eat me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD_STARVING = "All right! All right! I'll feed you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT = "Hardly any meat on that bone to put meat on your bones."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED = "Dry. Chewy. Ready to be eaten."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SMASHINGPOT = "Never pass up an opportunity to smash a pot."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SMELTER = "It takes the heavy metal and makes it heavier."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKE = "I admire your capacity to fit so much annoying into such a small body."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKEBONESOUP = "A good soup made from bad things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN_BURNT = "I don't miss it, to be honest."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN_CHOPPED = "It'll grow back. I hope."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN_GENERIC = "Look at all those ropey branches just waiting to be used."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL = "I know it's a fake, but I still just have to try it!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN = "Soft. Supple. Not currently attached to a snake. I like it!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT = "A good hat if you don't like being struck by lightning."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINSAIL = "Too heavy for balloon material. Just right for a sail."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_AMPHIBIOUS = "Don't want to bother you. I'll just be on my way."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_BONE = "No meat on this bone, but I bet it'd be good for a soup."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_FIRE = "I admire your capacity to fit so much annoying into such a small body."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_POISON = "You're poison does nothing to endear you to me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_DEAD = "I promise, I will go on without you!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_GENERIC = "Well, I wanted an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_SLEEPING = "It's dreaming of ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE = "Aw. It's shy."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH = "Should've been a catfish. I might've taken pity on you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPAT = "I'm sure he has a winning personality."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR = "Looks sharp. Sharp could come in handy around here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPEARGUN = "I prefer it when firing projectiles is accompanied by a honking noise."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPEARGUN_POISON = "Takes the fun out of hand-to-hand combat. I'm okay with that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LAUNCHER = "It's like a Pew-matic. But obviously not as good."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_OBSIDIAN = "For all my night spearing needs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_POISON = "Who needs quick deaths when they can be slow and painful?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR = "Looks sharp. Sharp could come in handy around here."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPICYVEGSTINGER = "It could be spicier."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DEAD = "I'd say a few words but I don't speak spider."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_GENERIC = "I've seen bigger spiders. Oh wait, no I haven't."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SLEEPING = "Sleeping on the job."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN = "So rich they lined their walls with silk."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK = "Swell. I can make more horrible things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND = "Can't let this gross thing go to waste."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT = "It'll be all the rage in the murky places."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE = "Looks like a swell place to live."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN = "I don't suppose she's more afraid of me than I am of her."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER = "It's rude to just drop in on someone like that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER = "Found you!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_DEAD = "It's better this way."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_GENERIC = "Because being a giant ape wasn't enough, you had to add spider legs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_SLEEPING = "I'm just going to sneak by..."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_NEST = "Looks sticky. And stinky."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MONKEY_TREE = "Not really a 'tree climbing' tree."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER = "You're not making any friends with your attitude."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR_DEAD = "I promise, I will go on without you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR_GENERIC = "That's a nice color on you."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR_SLEEPING = "I'll just tip-toe by."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH = "Mmm... smells like my home cooking."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD = "Am I really that desperate for adventure?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM = "At least they're glowing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM_INV = "I bet I could make you work for me somehow."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL = "I get it. You can fly and I can't. Quit rubbing it in."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL_INV = "Small. Glowy. Smells like cellar."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL = "Glad I'm not allergic to mold."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL_INV = "Well, they won't fit in the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SPRINKLER = "I'll be honest, I'm probably going to run through it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT = "Haha! Always knew I'd reach the stars."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO = "I think I'll see which way the wind blows before I use this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE = "I'm going to go ahead and guess it's a rock."
