GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH = "I thought I was having steamed clams."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL = "Of course that sheep would have scratchy wool."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.STINGER = "So cute and projectile-y."
