GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10 = "Treasures like this make the adventuring life worthwhile."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11 = "Swell. My new co-pilot."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12 = "I wonder if they want it back."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13 = "I don't know what this is, but it looks refreshing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14 = "A little short."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15 = "Don't know how to play. And I don't really want to learn."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16 = "It's either an important clue to an adventure, or it's completely useless to me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17 = "It's got a hole in it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18 = "Swell. Just what I always wanted."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19 = "Not my kind of adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2 = "What kind of monster would create a kazoo you can't use!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20 = "Looks like... something I don't know how to use."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21 = "I'd like it better if it was a balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22 = "I guess it's treasure?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23 = "Interesting... I don't know what it is."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3 = "I've found knots like this in my balloon rigging."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4 = "Pity I don't have a lawn to put it on."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5 = "I'd fly it to the moon if I could."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6 = "I bet someone would find this valuable. Not me, but someone."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7 = "I'll play this in my down-time. Which is never."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8 = "I'm more a showerer myself."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9 = "I think I figured out where all the lost buttons go."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_1 = "Swell. A stone dolly."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_3 = "Do they have mail service around here?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_GIFTSHOP_4 = "It's an inferior Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TROPICALBOUILLABAISSE = "The fins are still in there. Just the way I like it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TROPICALFAN = "If I had enough of these, you think I could fly away?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TROPICAL_FISH = "Looks like it'd make a beautiful lunch."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER = "Now I'm only slightly freezing cold."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER = "I bet it'd be even warmer if there were sleeves."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED = "I hope it tastes like chicken. And not nose."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER = "Swell. I'll add it to my collection of nose related treasures."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER = "Am I supposed to be proud of this?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUSTY_SHOOTER = "My trusty-dusty, handy-dandy, Pew-matic Horn."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE = "A tree made of tubers! That'll be an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP = "It's ripe. Well ripe-ish."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_BLOOM_CROP_COOKED = "So good I'll even eat the flower."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP = "How adventurous am I feeling?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUBER_CROP_COOKED = "A nice meal of tubers."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED = "The chase is on!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN = "Canned fish! What an adventure!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TURBINE_BLADES = "Doesn't look like the kind that would fall off a plane."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TURF_ASH = "Do I really need to drag this dirt around with me?"
