GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TURF_VOLCANO = "Do I really need to drag this dirt around with me?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR = "Do I really need to drag this floor around with me?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER = "Things are looking up."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TWIGS = "Sticks and stones may break my bones, but they'll also make a lot of tools."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TWISTER = "Swell. Now the wind is alive."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TWISTER_SEAL = "It's always the cutest things that cause the most destruction."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA = "Because you never know when it's going to rain. Unless you check the weather reports."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.UNAGI = "Wrap it anyway you like, it's still a dead fish."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED = "I don't know what it's supposed to do, but it's not doing it now."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT_DEAD = "Grounded for good."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT_GENERIC = "A misuse of flying abilities."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT_SLEEPING = "If I could only steal its wings while its asleep."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE = "Those bats are wasting their time in a cave when they should be outside flying."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BAT_WING = "Maybe if I flapped it really fast I could get off the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND = "Swell. A sack of goop from an animal."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK = "Hope this comes in handy. Otherwise that flytrap died for nothing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VINE = "The kind of thing that would be more useful if I had a bunch of them."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO = "A blistering adventure waiting to happen."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VOLCANOSTAFF = "This has adventure written all over it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR_GENERIC = "Well if that doesn't say adventure I don't know what does."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR_OPEN = "How about I just chuck things in and see what it does."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR_BROKEN = "How can it hibernate in this weather."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR_TOWER = "Looks old. Old and adventure-y."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_EXIT = "Back to the \"Regular\" world."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB = "I always find plant life in the strangest of places."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES = "I'm eating them for dinner because I'm adventurous."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALKINGSTICK = "Dried flytrap stalks really put a spring in my step."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALLCRACK_RUINS = "Not conspicuous at all."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALLYINTRO_DEBRIS = "What are you doing with a boat, bird?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE = "Keep the bad guys out, but don't fence me in."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE_ITEM = "I'm no architect, but I know this works better on the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_BURNT = "Can't say I didn't see that coming."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_GENERIC = "I'm sure this will keep the monsters at bay."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM = "Swell. Nothing more durable than a wall of grass."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE = "Those coral better do a good job or they're going right back into the sea."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE_ITEM = "As much as I love carrying this around, I think it would be better on the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK = "Nothing can get past these walls. Unless it drops from the sky."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM = "I'll bet my left toe this will be better on the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS = "Looks like it's been wallpapered."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS = "No better use for a precious rock than building a wall."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM = "Better not drop this on my toe."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE = "I'm going to miss it when a monster tears it down."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM = "You know this would be a lot more useful on the ground."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_BURNT = "What did I think would happen?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_GENERIC = "At least I don't have to paint it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM = "A fence should be in the ground. That's 'Fence Building 101'."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS = "If only I could grow a mustache like that."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT = "All the rage with the sane people this season."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP_EMPTY = "They picked up and left in a hurry."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP_GENERIC = "How adorable. They think they're people!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK = "Big deal, it's a tooth. I have a bunch of them in my mouth."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE_BURNING = "Someone's obviously jealous of my keen fashion sense."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE_BURNT = "There go my dreams of being a fashion guru."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE_GENERIC = "An adventurer needs an adventurous wardrobe."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WARG = "You'd be better as a cat."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE = "I gotta admit, those horrible bees sure can build a house."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WATERCHEST = "Waterborne storage."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WATERCROCODOG = "Allow me to avoid you altogether."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WATERDROP = "Another life of adventure!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON = "A big ball of fruit."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT = "Admit it. I look good in this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE = "Frozen fruit on a stick. A meal fit for kings."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED = "Are those grill marks or big seeds."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS = "Tiny torpedos you can also plant."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WATERYGRAVE = "That looks like something I should check for treasure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER = "If only it kept me as dry and warm as my things."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL = "That's an adventure waiting to happen."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL = "I should bury it before it starts haunting me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE = "Aggravating bugs! A complete waste of wings."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE = "Light enough to fire out the Pew-matic."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP = "Typical of my culinary talents."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BLUE = "Found it!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BUBBLES = "There lies adventure!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_BLUE = "Swell. That's a smell I'll never forget."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_WHITE = "A rare form of rotting carcass spotted in the wild."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WHALE_TRACK = "There lies adventure!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WHALE_WHITE = "I've heard tell of this elusive creature."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WHEELER_TRACKER = "Point the way to adventure!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_CROWN = "My head's too big. And this crown is too tarnished."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_UNLOCK = "Looks oddly like he needs a crown."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WILDBORE = "Don't take this the wrong way, but I'm going to leave."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHEAD = "That looks like something I should avoid."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHOUSE = "I'd rather live on my balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_GREENHOUSE = "Reminds me there's a whole world out there full of adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE = "Some nice natural light."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_LARGE_SQUARE_CURTAIN = "It lets in the light."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND = "I'll take it."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_BURLAP = "I might need new curtains."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_ROUND_CURTAINS_NAILS = "It lets in the light."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_SMALL_PEAKED = "It lets in the light."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_SMALL_PEAKED_CURTAIN = "It lets in the light."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_TALL = "A natural light source."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINDOW_TALL_CURTAIN = "A nice natural light source."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WIND_CONCH = "I could've used this on my balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT = "I'll wear it and think of summer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER_BURNT = "Wonder what the temperature of that fire was."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER_GENERIC = "Every aeronaut needs one in her possession."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSBOAT = "But can it fly?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT = "Does it make me look piratical?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSSAIL = "I'd rather have a balloon."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE = "Someone needs rescuing!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY1 = "Bone key. Not the first one I've seen."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2 = "Gold and keys. Two sure signs of an adventure."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY3 = "Where there's a key, there's a lock."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WOOD_DOOR = "More storage space. I like it!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WORM_DIRT = "Nothing less suspicious than a pile of dirt."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WORM_PLANT = "Oh! Shiny thing!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WORM_WORM = "You seem angry. Maybe we can talk this out."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_GENERIC = "Nothing more adventurous than a gigantic open mouth."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_OPEN = "Here goes nothing."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED = "It's seen better days."
