GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEEKHEN_SLEEPING = "Getting some shut eye."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEG_LEG = "Can I chop this?"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN = "Doesn't matter if you're from the Great White North. Still a bird."
