GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE_VALID = "She be in focus now!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEBRELLA = "Saves the wood in ol'Woodleg's wooden legs."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_ACTIVE = "I don't be knowin' where it leads, but it be ready ta take me."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_GENERIC = "Could take ol'Woodlegs ta seas-end!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_LOCKED = "Thar be a piece a'missin'."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE_PARTIAL = "It be nigh ready."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX = "A simple pirate like me ain't be knowin' whut this be fer."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK = "Ta my eye it be a crank fer crankin'."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_BASE = "A vessel. But na a seagoin' one."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_BOX = "Well, tha be'a strange sight."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_CRANK = "Thar be'a use ta it. But me na knowin't."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_POTATO = "Ol' Woodlegs'll take it with'im."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_HAMLET_RING = "It be'a hummin'."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO = "Strange armor be this."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING = "A ring wit' no jewels, bah!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BASE = "What a curious piece."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BOX = "Thar be secrets hidden in this here box."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_CRANK = "Aye, Woodlegs'll give it a crank."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_POTATO = "Whut a potatey needs a helmet fer me never be knowin'."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_RING = "I'd give it a bite, but I know it don't be gold."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELESCOPE = "Aye eye!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF = "I prefer a fast ship and th'wind at me back."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TELIPAD = "A teleport o' call."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TENT_BURNT = "Thet's whut ye get fer trustin' yer snoozes ta land."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TENT_GENERIC = "I prefers a water bed."
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE = "Like in me dreams!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE = "Aha! Now th'creepin' dread be in me own hands!"
GLOBAL.STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS = "Me memory be spotty. Whut's this fer again?"
